isten-only mode. After the presentation, we will conduct a question-and-answer session')\\n('truenorth:transcript:ASML:2026-10-14', 'ASML Holding', 'ASML Q3 FY2026 Earnings Call', \\\"# ASML Q3 FY2026 Earnings Call\\\\n**Operator:** Good day, and thank you for standing by. Welcome to the ASML 26 Third Quarter Financial Results Conference Call on 10/14/2026, After the speakers' introduction, there will be a question-and-answer session. To ask a question during the session, you will ne\\\")\\n('truenorth:transcript:AVGO:2026-09-02', 'Broadcom', 'AVGO Q3 FY2026 Earnings Call', \\\"# AVGO Q3 FY2026 Earnings Call\\\\n**Operator:** Welcome to Broadcom Inc.'s Third Quarter Fiscal Year 2026 Financial Results Conference Call. At this time, for opening remarks and introductions, I would like to turn the call over to Ji Yoo, Head of Investor Relations of Broadcom Inc. Please go ahead.\\\\n**\\\")\\n('truenorth:transcript:CRWV:2026-08-11', 'CoreWeave', 'CRWV Q2 FY2026 Earnings Call', \\\"# CRWV Q2 FY2026 Earnings Call\\\\n**Operator:** Hello, everyone. Thank you for joining us, and welcome to CoreWeave's Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Call. [Operator Instructions] I will now hand the conference over to CoreWeave. Please go ahead.\\\\n**Unknown Executive:** Thank you. Good afternoon, and welco\\\")\\n('truenorth:transcript:DELL:2026-09-01', 'Dell Technologies', 'DELL Q2 FY2027 Earnings Call', \\\"# DELL Q2 FY2027 Earnings Call\\\\n**Operator:** Good afternoon, and welcome to the Fiscal Year 2027 Second Quarter Financial Results Conference Call for Dell Technologies Inc. I'd like to inform all participants this call is being recorded at the request of Dell Technologies. This broadcast is the copy\\\")\\n('truenorth:transcript:META:2026-07-29', 'Meta Platforms', 'META Q2 FY2026 Earnings Call', \\\"# META Q2 FY2026 Earnings Call\\\\n**Operator:** Hello, and welcome to Meta's Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Conference Call. At this time, I would like to welcome everyone to Meta's Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Conference Call. And this call will be recorded. Thank you very much. Chad Heaton, Meta's Vice\\\")\\n('truenorth:transcript:META:2026-10-21', 'Meta Platforms', 'META Q3 FY2026 Earnings Call', \\\"# META Q3 FY2026 Earnings Call\\\\n**Operator:** Good afternoon. My name is Krista, and I will be your conference operator. Today. At this time, I would like to welcome everyone to Meta's Third Quarter 26 Earnings Conference Call. All lines have been placed on mute to prevent any background noise. After\\\")\\n('truenorth:transcript:MSFT:2026-07-29', 'Microsoft', 'MSFT Q4 FY2026 Earnings Call', '# MSFT Q4 FY2026 Earnings Call\\\\n**Operator:** Greetings, and welcome to the Microsoft Fiscal Year 2026 Fourth Quarter Earnings Conference Call. As a reminder, this conference is being recorded. It is now my pleasure to introduce Jonathan Neilson, Vice President of Investor Relations. Please go ahead.')\\n('truenorth:transcript:MU:2026-09-30', 'Micron Technology', 'MU Q4 FY2026 Earnings Call', \\\"# MU Q4 FY2026 Earnings Call\\\\n**Operator:** Hello, everyone. Thank you for joining us, and welcome to Micron's Fourth Quarter Post-Earnings Analyst Call. [Operator Instructions] I will now hand the conference over to Satya Kumar, Corporate Vice President, Investor Relations and Treasury. Satya, pleas\\\")\\n('truenorth:transcript:ORCL:2026-09-10', 'Oracle', 'ORCL Q1 FY2027 Earnings Call', '# ORCL Q1 FY2027 Earnings Call\\\\n**Operator:** Good day, everyone, and welcome to the Oracle Corporation First quarter fiscal year 27 earnings call. Just a reminder that this call is being recorded. If you have a question today, please press 1 on your telephone keypad. Please limit yourself to 1 quest')\\n('truenorth:transcript:SMCI:2026-08-11', 'Super Micro Computer', 'SMCI Q4 FY2026 Earnings Call', \\\"# SMCI Q4 FY2026 Earnings Call\\\\n**Operator:** Thank you for standing by. My name is Jen, and I will be your conference operator today. At this time, I would like to welcome everyone to the Super Micro Computer, Inc. Q4 FY '26 Business Update Call. With us today are Charles Liang, Founder, President a\\\")\\n('truenorth:transcript:TSM:2026-10-15', 'Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing', 'TSM Q3 FY2026 Earnings Call', \\\"# TSM Q3 FY2026 Earnings Call\\\\n**Jeff Su:** Good afternoon, everyone, and welcome to TSMC's third quarter 2026 earnings conference call. This is Jeff Su, TSMC's Director of Investor Relations and your host for today. TSMC is hosting our earnings conference call via live audio webcast through the comp\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_019fa144-e165-7c82-9e62-eda545606513', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia Reportedly Moves to Backstop $250 Billion in OpenAI Data Center Financing, Michael Burry Says, 'Around and Around We Go'\\\", \\\"Nvidia Reportedly Moves to Backstop $250 Billion in OpenAI Data Center Financing, Michael Burry Says, 'Around and Around We Go'\\\\nNvidia is reportedly in talks to provide a $250 billion financing guarantee for OpenAI's data center project in Ohio, with Michael Burry and Ed Zitron raising concerns abou\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_019fa1ad-b65a-70f3-8475-22532b009667', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia Deepens South Korea AI Push With $1 Billion NAVER Investment', 'Nvidia Deepens South Korea AI Push With $1 Billion NAVER Investment\\\\nNVIDIA plans to invest $1 billion in NAVER by purchasing newly issued shares, deepening its AI push in South Korea with a focus on expanding AI datacenter infrastructure using Vera Rubin and Blackwell systems.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_019fa5b7-4053-7212-a591-5ca748ead6bb', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia Funds AI Frenzy: Timeline of its Circular Financing Deals ... So Far', 'Nvidia Funds AI Frenzy: Timeline of its Circular Financing Deals ... So Far\\\\nNvidia is in talks to finance a $250 billion data center for OpenAI, with potential total project costs exceeding $500 billion. This follows a pattern of Nvidia providing financing that recipients use to purchase Nvidia chip')\\n('truenorth:story:story_019fa833-9f24-7c73-853c-6b0a122a3f9a', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia Employee Detained in Taiwan as Prosecutors Allege AI Chip Smuggling to China: Report', 'Nvidia Employee Detained in Taiwan as Prosecutors Allege AI Chip Smuggling to China: Report\\\\nTaiwanese prosecutors detained an Nvidia employee for allegedly falsifying documents to smuggle advanced AI chips to China via Super Micro servers. The case is part of a broader global crackdown involving U.S')\\n('truenorth:story:story_019fa914-c6dc-73a3-820a-7ad50cb9124f', 'benzinga.com', \\\"NVDA Down 6% in Two Days: What's Happening to Nvidia's Default Insurance Costs?\\\", \\\"NVDA Down 6% in Two Days: What's Happening to Nvidia's Default Insurance Costs?\\\\nNvidia's credit default swaps surged 14 basis points to a record high amid reports the company is in early talks to guarantee up to $250 billion in financing for OpenAI's data center project, raising concerns about balan\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_019fa924-cc13-75d2-b8ba-2f591f30d0b4', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Corning's AI-Fueled Expectations Crush the Stock\\\", \\\"Corning's AI-Fueled Expectations Crush the Stock\\\\nCorning (GLW) reported Q2 earnings that beat estimates (EPS $0.78 vs $0.76, revenue $4.74B vs $4.61B) with strong optical growth (+32%) and AI deals with NVDA and AMZN. However, Q3 guidance was in line with expectations, leading to a ~20% share price \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_019fa995-2c61-7c81-8d59-10fad4dba818', 'benzinga.com', 'Coherent, Lumentum, Ciena Stocks Fall After Corning Earnings Trigger Sector Selloff', 'Coherent, Lumentum, Ciena Stocks Fall After Corning Earnings Trigger Sector Selloff\\\\nCorning reported Q2 earnings beat (EPS $0.78 vs $0.76 est, revenue $4.74B vs $4.61B est) and in-line Q3 guidance, which triggered a sector selloff in optical/connectivity peers Coherent, Lumentum, and Ciena.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_019fcc91-2844-75f3-8908-cb6005710f67', 'benzinga.com', \\\"'Nvidia, Dell Back AI Cloud Startup Volta at $2.4 Billion Value' - Bloomberg\\\", \\\"'Nvidia, Dell Back AI Cloud Startup Volta at $2.4 Billion Value' - Bloomberg\\\\nNvidia and Dell have invested in AI cloud startup Volta at a $2.4 billion valuation, according to Bloomberg.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_019fce63-1014-7d81-a427-f420fc66466c', 'benzinga.com', 'SpaceX Is Partnering With NVIDIA To Design The Starmind AI1 Satellite Compute Payload; Each Of The Starmind Satellites Will Include NVIDIA Rubin GPUs And Vera CPUs For Datacenter Class Space Compute', 'SpaceX Is Partnering With NVIDIA To Design The Starmind AI1 Satellite Compute Payload; Each Of The Starmind Satellites Will Include NVIDIA Rubin GPUs And Vera CPUs For Datacenter Class Space Compute\\\\nSpaceX and NVIDIA are partnering to design the Starmind AI1 satellite compute payload, with each sate')\\n('truenorth:story:story_019fd0ad-ed87-72e2-84a6-7715fbe442bb', 'benzinga.com', 'Musk Praises Vera Rubin Platform on SpaceX Earnings Call, Nvidia Stock Climbs', \\\"Musk Praises Vera Rubin Platform on SpaceX Earnings Call, Nvidia Stock Climbs\\\\nElon Musk announced on SpaceX's earnings call that SpaceX will build exclusively on Nvidia, causing Nvidia shares to rise in extended trading.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_019fd1d9-555c-7d70-8a5e-0aae3fc3c088', 'benzinga.com', \\\"QUICK SPARK: SpaceX Goes All-In on Nvidia. Jim Cramer Thinks That's All Investors Need to Know.\\\", \\\"QUICK SPARK: SpaceX Goes All-In on Nvidia. Jim Cramer Thinks That's All Investors Need to Know.\\\\nElon Musk announced that SpaceX will use Nvidia GPUs exclusively, and JPMorgan expects SpaceX to receive a significant share of Nvidia's 2027 shipments, deepening their partnership.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_019fdc5e-9cb8-7a10-9005-45aa6a1c904a', 'benzinga.com', \\\"AMD Buys AI Chip Startup Taalas—Here's Why It Matters To NVDA Investors\\\", \\\"AMD Buys AI Chip Startup Taalas—Here's Why It Matters To NVDA Investors\\\\nAMD announced the acquisition of AI chip startup Taalas, which specializes in model-specific silicon for faster and cheaper inference. This deal intensifies competition with Nvidia in the AI inference market.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_019fdda6-6242-7230-94e0-3924ef57daba', 'benzinga.com', 'The AI Chip Trade Is Getting Bigger — and More Leveraged. Meet REX’s New 3X Bets', \\\"The AI Chip Trade Is Getting Bigger — and More Leveraged. Meet REX’s New 3X Bets\\\\nREX has launched new 3X leveraged semiconductor ETNs (SMHU and SMHD) to capitalize on AI-driven demand and volatility in the semiconductor sector. The article highlights record inflows into semiconductor ETFs, SMH's 60%\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_019fe6fe-191d-7ec3-b0ef-693423bd9cdf', 'benzinga.com', 'US-China AI War: Inside the Battle for Global Tech Dominance', \\\"US-China AI War: Inside the Battle for Global Tech Dominance\\\\nThe article covers the escalating US-China AI competition, highlighted by China's Moonshot AI releasing Kimi K3, which caused a 1.4% Nasdaq drop on July 17. The White House accused Moonshot of stealing US technology via distillation of Ant\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_019feb0e-2d2e-73c1-90aa-7bd4f056e57f', 'benzinga.com', 'Taiwan Semiconductor’s Blockbuster Run Rolls On: July Revenue Surges 45%', 'Taiwan Semiconductor’s Blockbuster Run Rolls On: July Revenue Surges 45%\\\\nTaiwan Semiconductor reported July revenue of NT$467.58 billion, up 44.7% YoY and 5.6% MoM, with YTD revenue up 37% to NT$2.872 trillion. The company also raised its 2026 capex outlook to $60-64 billion and expects full-year sa')\\n('truenorth:story:story_019fec2c-bac6-7fb0-9a7c-f8d0fe40a6b8', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia Built the AI Brain, Now TSMC Wants to Give It Eyes', 'Nvidia Built the AI Brain, Now TSMC Wants to Give It Eyes\\\\nTSMC and Sony are planning a $6.3 billion joint venture for image sensors, positioning TSMC for growth in AI-driven robotics and autonomous vehicles. Production is expected to begin in 2029.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_019feeea-b3ca-7b32-a8ca-2dc921d04f8c', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang Says 'First Time' That Chips Have Become An Investable Asset Class as BlackRock, Blackstone and Others Join $500 Billion AI Push\\\", \\\"Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang Says 'First Time' That Chips Have Become An Investable Asset Class as BlackRock, Blackstone and Others Join $500 Billion AI Push\\\\nNvidia CEO Jensen Huang announced a new initiative with six Wall Street firms to raise $500 billion for AI infrastructure, positioning chips as an \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_019ff091-ef1d-7bc3-a58f-44fb941939ef', 'benzinga.com', \\\"NVIDIA's Jensen Huang Says AI Isn’t Just Tech Anymore — It’s Infrastructure, and Wall Street Is Financing It\\\", \\\"NVIDIA's Jensen Huang Says AI Isn’t Just Tech Anymore — It’s Infrastructure, and Wall Street Is Financing It\\\\nNVIDIA is partnering with Wall Street firms including Goldman Sachs and BlackRock to unlock over $500 billion for AI infrastructure and GPU financing, positioning AI chips as long-lived, reve\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_019ff3c2-b5c8-71a1-b9af-ca482478f643', 'benzinga.com', \\\"CoreWeave Stock Surges Nearly 16% After Earnings, Analyst Says Old Nvidia GPUs Can 'Still Generate Revenue Nearly a Decade Later'\\\", \\\"CoreWeave Stock Surges Nearly 16% After Earnings, Analyst Says Old Nvidia GPUs Can 'Still Generate Revenue Nearly a Decade Later'\\\\nCoreWeave reported Q2 revenue of $2.58B, beating estimates, with a narrower adjusted loss. The company highlighted a $104B backlog and provided Q3 guidance. Analysts comm\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_019ff45c-6357-7620-a9b3-52bbdf427f74', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Jim Cramer Asks if Wall Street's 'Long Knives' for Nvidia Should Stay Sheathed as CoreWeave Powers Neocloud Optimism\\\", \\\"Jim Cramer Asks if Wall Street's 'Long Knives' for Nvidia Should Stay Sheathed as CoreWeave Powers Neocloud Optimism\\\\nCoreWeave reported Q2 earnings that beat expectations, with revenue of $2.58B vs $2.56B expected and a narrower adjusted loss of $1.03 vs $1.22 expected. The company raised full-year \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_019ff593-4909-79e2-be2e-d62881553377', 'benzinga.com', \\\"FLY Stock Climbs Over 4% During Wednesday Pre-Market: What's Going On?\\\", \\\"FLY Stock Climbs Over 4% During Wednesday Pre-Market: What's Going On?\\\\nFirefly Aerospace reported record Q2 revenue of $117.7 million, up 659% YoY, beating estimates, with adjusted loss of $0.42 per share better than expected. Growth driven by NASA, national security contracts, and Nvidia collaborat\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_019ff6e8-5134-7f71-92d0-893bccacf954', 'benzinga.com', 'Lumentum Posts Solid Q4, Set To Hit $1.25B Revenue Target 3 Months Early', 'Lumentum Posts Solid Q4, Set To Hit $1.25B Revenue Target 3 Months Early\\\\nLumentum reported strong Q4 results with revenue surpassing $1 billion, up 190% YoY, and guided Q1 revenue to $1.25 billion, beating expectations and hitting its mid-term target a quarter early. Shares rose 14.89% to $942.75.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_019ff6f8-3e38-7b11-bf8c-912b4b230c55', 'benzinga.com', 'Stock Market Today: Nasdaq 100 Rises on Strong AI Earnings, Benign Inflation', 'Stock Market Today: Nasdaq 100 Rises on Strong AI Earnings, Benign Inflation\\\\nAI infrastructure earnings lifted tech stocks and the Nasdaq 100, while a consensus-matched CPI print cooled yields and trimmed September Fed hike odds.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_019ffb2c-4c8d-7de2-8521-9db4eef52e1d', 'benzinga.com', 'AMD’s 2027 Server Revenue Outlook Is Already 20% Bigger Than the Entire 2025 Market', 'AMD’s 2027 Server Revenue Outlook Is Already 20% Bigger Than the Entire 2025 Market\\\\nAMD outlined aggressive AI and server growth plans at its Technology Leadership Forum 2026, targeting over 80% server revenue growth in H2 2026 and at least 70% in 2027, backed by Helios customer commitments and clou')\\n('truenorth:story:story_019ffb7b-df23-7c93-856b-d0170706ac85', 'benzinga.com', 'IREN Jumps 10% as Microsoft Accepts First AI Data Center Under $9.7 Billion Deal', \\\"IREN Jumps 10% as Microsoft Accepts First AI Data Center Under $9.7 Billion Deal\\\\nIREN's stock jumped 10% after Microsoft accepted the first AI data center under a $9.7 billion deal, marking a key milestone in IREN's pivot from Bitcoin mining to AI infrastructure. The acceptance triggers monthly invo\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_019ffbbe-d6ca-7be2-8c8f-9e7e4d922970', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Why Nvidia May Stand in the Way of Wall Street's Plans to Turn AI Compute Into a Commodity\\\", \\\"Why Nvidia May Stand in the Way of Wall Street's Plans to Turn AI Compute Into a Commodity\\\\nCME Group plans to launch futures contracts on Nvidia H100 and B200 compute, aiming to create a standardized commodity market for AI compute. However, Nvidia's dominance over supply and pricing may hinder the \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_019ffbc5-319c-7d50-a059-bf7048fd499b', 'benzinga.com', 'IREN Hands Microsoft Its First AI Cloud Deployment', 'IREN Hands Microsoft Its First AI Cloud Deployment\\\\nIREN stock rose 6.92% after delivering Horizon 1, the first of four planned 50MW AI cloud deployments for Microsoft under a $9.7B five-year contract, and securing NVIDIA Exemplar Cloud status.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_019ffc1e-87c4-7453-87dd-1e713140ad2b', 'benzinga.com', 'AMD Prepares Record $5B Bond Sale to Fuel Massive AI Expansion', 'AMD Prepares Record $5B Bond Sale to Fuel Massive AI Expansion\\\\nAMD is preparing a record $5 billion bond sale across four tranches with maturities from three to ten years, to fund AI infrastructure expansion and refinance debt. The company has not finalized the offering size, which may change based ')\\n('truenorth:story:story_019ffc4d-37df-7b81-a1d2-1c72dc8c1936', 'benzinga.com', 'Nebius Says AI Compute Prices Jumped 15%, Signaling Strong Pricing Power', 'Nebius Says AI Compute Prices Jumped 15%, Signaling Strong Pricing Power\\\\nNebius Group reported that its first AI capacity auction cleared at a price 15% above its previous highest, indicating strong customer willingness to pay for scarce AI computing power. The auction, which involved access to Nvid')\\n('truenorth:story:story_019ffc6d-49db-73b0-9cfa-4689323d0ef9', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Dell Rallies 2% After Lenovo's AI Server Pipeline Hits $54 Billion, Fueling Nvidia Demand Optimism\\\", \\\"Dell Rallies 2% After Lenovo's AI Server Pipeline Hits $54 Billion, Fueling Nvidia Demand Optimism\\\\nLenovo reported record quarterly results with AI server pipeline surging 157% to $54 billion, reinforcing strong AI infrastructure demand. Dell shares rose 2.5% following the news, with Super Micro's b\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_019fff6a-bea9-70d0-b03b-666f5ebe7635', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia's Next-Gen Feynman AI Platform Is Ramping Up, Forcing TSMC to Race Ahead: Report\\\", \\\"Nvidia's Next-Gen Feynman AI Platform Is Ramping Up, Forcing TSMC to Race Ahead: Report\\\\nNvidia is reportedly accelerating development of its next-gen Feynman AI platform, pushing TSMC to ramp 2nm and advanced packaging capacity. The report highlights TSMC's expansion of SoIC and CoWoS capacity, with\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a00033-bc19-70e2-b821-58d32fcbc3ef', 'benzinga.com', 'NVIDIA Says ‘Free AI’ Is Great For Chips — Jensen Huang’s Open-Source Bet Could Fuel GPU Demand', 'NVIDIA Says ‘Free AI’ Is Great For Chips — Jensen Huang’s Open-Source Bet Could Fuel GPU Demand\\\\nNVIDIA released Nemotron 3.5 Lightning, an open-source AI model, and introduced NeMo Switchyard software. CEO Jensen Huang advocates for open-source AI, linking it to increased hardware demand. The compan')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0014d-05a7-7222-b775-a09b01383fe1', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia, Nancy Pelosi, Cathie Wood Strike Gold With Databricks' $190 Billion Valuation\\\", \\\"Nvidia, Nancy Pelosi, Cathie Wood Strike Gold With Databricks' $190 Billion Valuation\\\\nDatabricks raised $5 billion in a new funding round led by Coatue, valuing the company at $190 billion, up from $43 billion in September 2023. Early investors including Nvidia, Nancy Pelosi, and Cathie Wood's Ark I\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a00da7-9c2f-7d51-b8fe-2cfe4e291576', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Harvard Reveals $2.2 Billion SpaceX Stake, Its Largest Public Equity Holding: University's Bet on Elon Musk-led Company Outshines Amazon and Nvidia\\\", \\\"Harvard Reveals $2.2 Billion SpaceX Stake, Its Largest Public Equity Holding: University's Bet on Elon Musk-led Company Outshines Amazon and Nvidia\\\\nHarvard Management Co. disclosed a $2.2 billion stake in SpaceX, its largest public equity holding, via a 13F filing. The stake, held as of June 30, rep\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a00f11-b57d-7a80-b17d-df8968149e55', 'benzinga.com', 'Harvard Did Not Sell Its Bitcoin ETF Holdings in Q2, Discloses No New Ethereum ETF Stake', \\\"Harvard Did Not Sell Its Bitcoin ETF Holdings in Q2, Discloses No New Ethereum ETF Stake\\\\nHarvard University's 13F filing shows it held its Bitcoin ETF position steady in Q2, with 3.04 million shares of IBIT worth $101.35 million, while not adding any Ethereum ETF stake after liquidating it in Q1. Th\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a00f37-8c51-7103-8efd-9138a4064dcc', 'benzinga.com', \\\"HIVE Stock Jumps After AI Cloud Deal - Here's Why\\\", \\\"HIVE Stock Jumps After AI Cloud Deal - Here's Why\\\\nHIVE Digital Technologies announced a five-year GPU cloud services agreement worth approximately $350 million with an investment-grade enterprise customer, expected to add roughly $70 million in annualized revenue. Shares rose about 8% in premarket t\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a01023-a283-7851-8628-e75e38978be8', 'benzinga.com', 'NVIDIA’s Ohio AI Megadeal: OpenAI, 8 GW of Compute and a $1.5 Billion SB Energy Bet', 'NVIDIA’s Ohio AI Megadeal: OpenAI, 8 GW of Compute and a $1.5 Billion SB Energy Bet\\\\nNVIDIA and SB Energy partner to build an 8 GW AI campus in Ohio for OpenAI, with NVIDIA investing $1.5B in SB Energy. NVIDIA is also reworking its financing structure to reduce its initial guarantee from $250B to les')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0107f-1189-7443-b708-93eaa30d391f', 'benzinga.com', 'SpaceX Stock Is Everywhere: Google, Nvidia, AMD, Harvard Disclose Stakes', \\\"SpaceX Stock Is Everywhere: Google, Nvidia, AMD, Harvard Disclose Stakes\\\\nSpaceX's Nasdaq debut has made it one of the most widely disclosed names in Q2 13F filings, with major tech companies, hedge funds, and institutions revealing large positions. Alphabet disclosed a ~$94B stake, Nvidia ~$21B, AMD\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a010be-cc2c-7893-8cb4-60423f75a42a', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia-OpenAI Deal Isn't 'Circular Financing,' Says Jensen Huang, Sees $600B Compute Opportunity\\\", \\\"Nvidia-OpenAI Deal Isn't 'Circular Financing,' Says Jensen Huang, Sees $600B Compute Opportunity\\\\nNvidia CEO Jensen Huang refutes the 'circular financing' characterization of Nvidia's $1.5 billion investment in SB Energy for OpenAI's Ohio AI campus, framing it as securing infrastructure supply. He hi\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a01128-ef8e-78f1-a21a-c6f1083651fc', 'benzinga.com', 'SpaceX Stock Jumps After Multibillion-Dollar Stakes Revealed', \\\"SpaceX Stock Jumps After Multibillion-Dollar Stakes Revealed\\\\nSpaceX shares rose 4.17% to $145.84 after 13F filings revealed major institutional holdings, including Google's $94 billion stake, Nvidia's $21 billion stake, and AMD's first-ever $565.5 million position. Additional disclosures included Ha\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0146f-3bb8-7ab0-b435-a044470e2162', 'benzinga.com', 'Trump-Backed World Liberty Partners With Platform Offering Chinese AI Models Flagged by US: Report', 'Trump-Backed World Liberty Partners With Platform Offering Chinese AI Models Flagged by US: Report\\\\nWorld Liberty Financial, a Trump-backed crypto venture, has partnered with Hong Kong-based WorldClaw, which offers access to Chinese AI models including those from Alibaba and Baidu. The deal raises et')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a01504-3aca-7e51-825a-668b8d4c0f00', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Cisco, Nvidia, Amazon and Nokia: The Customer List Behind Fabrinet's AI Boom\\\", \\\"Cisco, Nvidia, Amazon and Nokia: The Customer List Behind Fabrinet's AI Boom\\\\nFabrinet reported fiscal Q4 earnings, revealing that Cisco, Nvidia, Nokia, and Amazon each account for more than 10% of annual revenue, highlighting the company's diversified role in AI infrastructure. Management expressed \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0158a-423f-7292-afab-e5ffd66fc11d', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia, AMD, Broadcom, Meta Slide as Bond Yields Surge: Why Tech Stocks Are Getting Hit', 'Nvidia, AMD, Broadcom, Meta Slide as Bond Yields Surge: Why Tech Stocks Are Getting Hit\\\\nTech and AI stocks fell sharply as the 30-year Treasury yield hit its highest level since 2007, with the 10-year around 4.73%. The selloff was concentrated in high-growth tech names, with AMD down 5%, Broadcom an')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0158c-7740-71d1-9fbe-48cc70e8cb27', 'benzinga.com', 'Citadel Advisors and Millennium Boosted Fabrinet Stakes in Q2 as AI Demand Accelerated', 'Citadel Advisors and Millennium Boosted Fabrinet Stakes in Q2 as AI Demand Accelerated\\\\nCitadel and Millennium significantly increased their Fabrinet (FN) stakes in Q2 2026, as disclosed in 13F filings. Fabrinet reported record results with a diversified customer base (Cisco 20%, Nvidia 16%, Nokia 11')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a015a5-b9ad-7a43-8e70-33e3a0708c37', 'benzinga.com', 'Fabrinet Shares Tumble As Nvidia Datacom Weakness Overshadows Telecom Strength', 'Fabrinet Shares Tumble As Nvidia Datacom Weakness Overshadows Telecom Strength\\\\nFabrinet reported strong Q4 FY2026 results with revenue and EPS beating estimates, but shares fell 20% due to declining Nvidia datacom sales and concerns about competition. Analysts reaffirmed Buy ratings with high price ')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a01811-3d71-7632-97f2-de168b8b61ab', 'benzinga.com', 'Elon Musk Warns Nvidia-Backed $105 Billion Ohio Data Center for OpenAI Will Take ‘Much Longer’ to Come Online Than Expected', \\\"Elon Musk Warns Nvidia-Backed $105 Billion Ohio Data Center for OpenAI Will Take ‘Much Longer’ to Come Online Than Expected\\\\nElon Musk publicly doubted the timeline for Nvidia's up to $105 billion Ohio data center project for OpenAI, citing potential delays. The project involves Nvidia's SEC-filed co\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a018b9-104c-7151-b4b9-b0b3e469e202', 'benzinga.com', 'Cerebras Stock Takes a Hit as New AI Server Targets Nvidia With Giant Chips and Faster Chatbot Queries', 'Cerebras Stock Takes a Hit as New AI Server Targets Nvidia With Giant Chips and Faster Chatbot Queries\\\\nCerebras unveiled its CS-4 AI server to challenge Nvidia, but its stock fell 12.69% after revenue missed estimates. Core revenue grew 103% YoY, and guidance for Q3 was provided.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a01942-08c8-7cb2-a8e0-e51c89430141', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia’s H200 Chips Are Flowing Into China Again: ByteDance, Tencent Get Around 10,000 Each, Report Says', \\\"Nvidia’s H200 Chips Are Flowing Into China Again: ByteDance, Tencent Get Around 10,000 Each, Report Says\\\\nChina has approved limited shipments of Nvidia's H200 AI chips to ByteDance and Tencent, with each receiving around 10,000 processors, signaling a cautious easing of restrictions. The approvals f\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a01985-2c6d-7472-baed-885c49e6cfea', 'benzinga.com', 'SKHY Stock Rips 6% in Premarket on $29 Billion Buyback Plan', 'SKHY Stock Rips 6% in Premarket on $29 Billion Buyback Plan\\\\nSK Hynix announced a $29 billion (40 trillion won) treasury share buyback and cancellation plan, along with a commitment to return over 50% of cumulative free cash flow from 2025-2027 to shareholders. The stock rose 5.56% in premarket tradi')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a01991-56de-70a2-93d2-88c96e4a3be6', 'benzinga.com', 'NVIDIA Supplier SK Hynix Rolls Out $29 Billion Buyback After AI Spending Fears Hammer Stock', 'NVIDIA Supplier SK Hynix Rolls Out $29 Billion Buyback After AI Spending Fears Hammer Stock\\\\nSK hynix stock rebounded 5% in premarket trading after announcing a $29 billion (40 trillion won) stock buyback plan and raising its shareholder return target to over 50% of free cash flow. The move follows a')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a019c8-0e5b-7df2-9fc6-8c4bdda6ea6a', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Jim Cramer Slams Data Center Reliance on Leveraged Retail-Driven SK Hynix, Samsung Stocks: 'Decided By Them, Not Us'\\\", \\\"Jim Cramer Slams Data Center Reliance on Leveraged Retail-Driven SK Hynix, Samsung Stocks: 'Decided By Them, Not Us'\\\\nSK Hynix announced a $29 billion (40 trillion won) share buyback and cancellation plan to support its stock amid AI demand concerns. Jim Cramer criticized the data center supply chain\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a01a36-a4f7-7aa1-95d2-06b570e0b49b', 'benzinga.com', 'NVDA Rival Cerebras Unveils New AI System It Says Is Up to 30X Faster Than Nvidia GPUs', 'NVDA Rival Cerebras Unveils New AI System It Says Is Up to 30X Faster Than Nvidia GPUs\\\\nCerebras unveiled its new CS-4 AI inference system, claiming up to 30x faster inference than Nvidia GPUs, with speeds exceeding 4,400 tokens per second per user on GPT-OSS-120B. The first systems are expected onli')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a01a75-17f5-7653-91cd-6bf3ab93c8c5', 'benzinga.com', 'Broadcom Rival Marvell Surges After Google Strikes AI Chip Deal, Gets Option to Buy $12.2B Stake', 'Broadcom Rival Marvell Surges After Google Strikes AI Chip Deal, Gets Option to Buy $12.2B Stake\\\\nMarvell announced a sweeping custom AI chip agreement with Google, including a warrant for Google to buy nearly 59 million Marvell shares at $206.58 each, potentially worth $12.2 billion. The deal could ')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a01b00-8458-7af3-bf3b-4a72fc171264', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Investors Should Position For Humanoid Robot Boom—Here's A Picks-And-Shovels Play; First mRNA Cancer Vaccine Succeeds\\\", \\\"Investors Should Position For Humanoid Robot Boom—Here's A Picks-And-Shovels Play; First mRNA Cancer Vaccine Succeeds\\\\nThe article covers multiple market-moving events: Moderna and Merck's Phase 3 mRNA cancer vaccine success, US Treasury doubling buyback support for long bonds, SK Hynix's $28B buybac\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a01bde-a23b-7e12-a2ae-20724c9385e9', 'benzinga.com', 'Samsung Tumbled Nearly 8% in Seoul Even as AI Demand Drives Chip Prices Up To 15%', \\\"Samsung Tumbled Nearly 8% in Seoul Even as AI Demand Drives Chip Prices Up To 15%\\\\nSamsung raised prices for advanced chipmaking services by up to 15% for new orders, driven by AI demand and full production lines. The move highlights pricing power in the semiconductor foundry market, even as Samsung'\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a01f76-7671-74b1-b8ec-790d3f11f6d6', 'benzinga.com', 'CoreWeave Lands Multibillion-Dollar Hudson River Deal as Wall Street Races for Nvidia Chips', \\\"CoreWeave Lands Multibillion-Dollar Hudson River Deal as Wall Street Races for Nvidia Chips\\\\nCoreWeave has secured a multibillion-dollar, multiyear AI cloud deal with Hudson River Trading, providing access to Nvidia's Vera Rubin and B200 systems. This follows a $6 billion commitment from Jane Street \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a01f84-eb78-7003-bf96-a3619f1d91b8', 'benzinga.com', \\\"A 10-Year Treasury Bond Now Pays More Than 118 Of America's Biggest Companies\\\", \\\"A 10-Year Treasury Bond Now Pays More Than 118 Of America's Biggest Companies\\\\nThe 10-year Treasury yield now exceeds the dividend yield of 118 S&P 500 mega-cap stocks, with only 3.85% of the index yielding more than the bond, the lowest since May 2007. This reflects rising long-term yields and low d\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a02009-f6f4-7421-a2b7-7cb042b79b24', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is SK Hynix Stock Surging on Thursday?', 'Why Is SK Hynix Stock Surging on Thursday?\\\\nSK Hynix announced a 40 trillion won ($29 billion) share buyback and cancellation plan, plus expanded free cash flow return commitments, driving its stock up 4.25%.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a023b9-2355-7e72-b586-582f54acafaf', 'benzinga.com', 'Broadcom Steps up NVIDIA Challenge With Potential $100 Billion AI Financing Deal', 'Broadcom Steps up NVIDIA Challenge With Potential $100 Billion AI Financing Deal\\\\nBroadcom is exploring a massive up to $100 billion AI financing package with Apollo and Blackstone to fund custom AI chips for customers like Anthropic. The deal is in discussion stages, with talks ongoing and potential')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a023de-e7e3-7de0-9166-b2db9f613441', 'benzinga.com', 'Waymo Unveils First Custom Robotaxi Chip With More Than 1,000 TOPS of AI Processing Power', \\\"Waymo Unveils First Custom Robotaxi Chip With More Than 1,000 TOPS of AI Processing Power\\\\nWaymo, Alphabet's autonomous driving unit, unveiled its first custom-designed robotaxi chip, a 5-nanometer ASIC with over 1,000 TOPS of AI processing power for real-time sensor data processing in its new Ojai v\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a023eb-f2a1-7441-af46-75d8745b0856', 'benzinga.com', 'NVIDIA Looks to Strengthen AI Empire With Potential Rebellions Deal', \\\"NVIDIA Looks to Strengthen AI Empire With Potential Rebellions Deal\\\\nNVIDIA is in preliminary talks with South Korean AI chip startup Rebellions about a potential technical partnership, investment, or acquisition. The discussions are exploratory and may not result in a transaction. NVIDIA's stock ros\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a024c4-e685-77d0-bf65-9dd563950310', 'benzinga.com', 'Modine Stock Jumps After Report Names Google, Amazon as Data Center Cooling Customers', \\\"Modine Stock Jumps After Report Names Google, Amazon as Data Center Cooling Customers\\\\nModine shares rose after Hunterbrook Media reported that Google is the unnamed customer behind Modine's $4 billion cooling agreement, with additional pipeline from Amazon and others. The report also suggests Modine\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a031b6-72ce-7be2-8be9-79c2b5462e44', 'benzinga.com', 'Remember Hugging Face? The AI Hub Hit by an OpenAI Security Breach Is Reportedly Exploring a $13 Billion Sale', 'Remember Hugging Face? The AI Hub Hit by an OpenAI Security Breach Is Reportedly Exploring a $13 Billion Sale\\\\nHugging Face, an open-source AI platform, is reportedly exploring a potential sale that could value the company at $13 billion or more, nearly tripling its 2023 valuation of $4.5 billion. Th')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a03201-1a85-7951-a679-fe5b82ffaa91', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia Is Coming for OpenAI and DeepSeek With $6 Billion Poolside Deal to Build a Powerful Open-Weight AI Model: Report', \\\"Nvidia Is Coming for OpenAI and DeepSeek With $6 Billion Poolside Deal to Build a Powerful Open-Weight AI Model: Report\\\\nNvidia is acquiring Poolside's AI technology for $6 billion and investing $1 billion at a $12 billion pre-money valuation, with over 100 employees joining Nvidia to work on open-we\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a033ea-1b5c-7473-872f-43321e036056', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Dan Ives Says Nvidia's 15% AI Server Price Hike Is Bullish for Tech. Could Micron Be the Real Winner?\\\", \\\"Dan Ives Says Nvidia's 15% AI Server Price Hike Is Bullish for Tech. Could Micron Be the Real Winner?\\\\nNvidia has reportedly informed major customers of a more than 15% price increase for AI servers shipping in early 2027, driven by surging memory costs. Analyst Dan Ives views this as bullish for AI \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a034ac-c1ff-7d02-8611-b20b7f13f4f3', 'benzinga.com', 'SpaceXAI Taps NVIDIA To Build Faster AI Agents', \\\"SpaceXAI Taps NVIDIA To Build Faster AI Agents\\\\nSpaceXAI, the AI division of SpaceX, announced a partnership with NVIDIA to deploy NVIDIA's Vera CPUs for agentic AI applications and expand Grok's infrastructure. The collaboration also includes plans to use NVIDIA's Vera Rubin platform for orbital com\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a034c7-84d7-70f2-a481-cdffe4a12335', 'benzinga.com', 'Memory Stocks Slide as Trump Threatens 50% Tariffs on Canadian Autos, Steel in 2027: Stock Market Today', 'Memory Stocks Slide as Trump Threatens 50% Tariffs on Canadian Autos, Steel in 2027: Stock Market Today\\\\nUS equities mixed as Trump escalates trade war with Canada via 50% auto tariffs, memory stocks slide on Samsung disappointment, and Bitcoin rallies past $79k.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a03501-58ad-7083-8bd7-84dd5c70a3a1', 'benzinga.com', \\\"EXCLUSIVE: How AI's $220 Billion Bond Boom Competes With the Treasury\\\", \\\"EXCLUSIVE: How AI's $220 Billion Bond Boom Competes With the Treasury\\\\nAI companies have issued $220B in debt this year, intensifying competition with Treasury supply and contributing to higher long-term yields. Treasury Secretary Bessent expanded buybacks, but analysts see limited impact. Commentary\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a03541-98e7-73b3-8645-f8d14d349a52', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Magnificent 7 Built The AI Boom, 'Munificent Seven' Wants to Power It\\\", \\\"Magnificent 7 Built The AI Boom, 'Munificent Seven' Wants to Power It\\\\nHarbor Capital Advisors launched the Munificent Seven ETF (BBLS), an actively managed fund targeting seven major energy companies positioned to benefit from surging electricity demand driven by AI infrastructure growth. The fund b\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a036fc-ca3f-78e3-b3f3-1298008ebac0', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Trump Snapped Up SpaceX Shares 11 Days After $1.77 Trillion IPO: Here's What Else He Purchased\\\", \\\"Trump Snapped Up SpaceX Shares 11 Days After $1.77 Trillion IPO: Here's What Else He Purchased\\\\nPresident Trump disclosed buying up to $50,000 in SpaceX shares shortly after its record IPO, along with other stock trades, raising conflict-of-interest questions as his administration advances space poli\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a03728-79db-7f72-bf5b-77c3603e7156', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Elizabeth Warren Says if Jensen Huang Has Time for $1 Million Mar-a-Lago Dinner, He Can 'Find Time to Testify' and Explain Nvidia Tech in Russian Drones\\\", \\\"Elizabeth Warren Says if Jensen Huang Has Time for $1 Million Mar-a-Lago Dinner, He Can 'Find Time to Testify' and Explain Nvidia Tech in Russian Drones\\\\nSenator Elizabeth Warren is pressuring Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang to testify before Congress after reports that Nvidia's Jetson Orin computers were fo\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a03834-2bf3-7020-bc02-47ee8cb9acc9', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia Manager Named ‘Key Figure’ in Alleged B300 GPU Smuggling to China, 8 Others Indicted in Taiwan Probe', 'Nvidia Manager Named ‘Key Figure’ in Alleged B300 GPU Smuggling to China, 8 Others Indicted in Taiwan Probe\\\\nTaiwanese prosecutors indicted nine individuals, including employees of Nvidia and Super Micro, for allegedly exporting prohibited B300 AI GPUs to China. 74 servers were successfully shipped v')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a03a59-3dba-7cf2-bd65-23fdfaca9e2d', 'benzinga.com', 'Leveraged Single-Stock ETF Closures Went From 3 To 63 In A Year As Money Piles Into Nvidia Bets', 'Leveraged Single-Stock ETF Closures Went From 3 To 63 In A Year As Money Piles Into Nvidia Bets\\\\nThe leveraged ETF market is undergoing a shakeout in 2026, with record launches but widespread closures and asset concentration in top products like NVDL, SOXL, and SOXS. The article highlights the trend ')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a03c58-cf2c-75d0-93ca-9e5268d2acd9', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Jim Cramer Sees 'No Real Competitors' to Nvidia, Even as Sam Altman Says OpenAI 'Made a Chip and It Is Fast'\\\", \\\"Jim Cramer Sees 'No Real Competitors' to Nvidia, Even as Sam Altman Says OpenAI 'Made a Chip and It Is Fast'\\\\nOpenAI announced its first custom inference chip, Jalapeño, developed with Broadcom, claiming significant efficiency and latency improvements over Nvidia's GB200 and GB300 chips. The chip is \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a03d04-0776-7890-a753-f3d09710ac24', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia, Zoom Communications and 3 Stocks to Watch Heading Into Wednesday', 'Nvidia, Zoom Communications and 3 Stocks to Watch Heading Into Wednesday\\\\nStock futures mixed; Intuit and Zoom reported earnings with guidance misses, while Nvidia, Williams-Sonoma, and Smucker are set to report.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a03d06-0e58-7a91-8aba-33273ad7929c', 'benzinga.com', 'Dow Gains for Third Session as Treasury Yields Fall: Investor Sentiment Improves, Fear Index Remains in ‘Greed’ Zone', 'Dow Gains for Third Session as Treasury Yields Fall: Investor Sentiment Improves, Fear Index Remains in ‘Greed’ Zone\\\\nU.S. stocks rose for a third session as Treasury yields fell, with the Dow gaining 160 points. The Fear & Greed Index improved to 58.6 (Greed zone). Economic data showed Case-Shiller ')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a03efa-9153-7cb0-80f4-b4451228c5a4', 'benzinga.com', 'Microsoft, Amazon, Google Court Kimi K3 Maker Despite Bessent Blacklist Threat', \\\"Microsoft, Amazon, Google Court Kimi K3 Maker Despite Bessent Blacklist Threat\\\\nMicrosoft, Amazon, and Google are in early talks with China's Moonshot AI for revenue-sharing deals on its Kimi K3 model, despite potential U.S. sanctions. The talks are preliminary and may not result in agreements.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a03fd1-ae9d-7e13-9776-7330b4bfa9a1', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia Q2 Highlights: Double Beat, Huang Says ‘AI Infrastructure Buildout is at Full Steam’', 'Nvidia Q2 Highlights: Double Beat, Huang Says ‘AI Infrastructure Buildout is at Full Steam’\\\\nNvidia reported Q2 FY2025 revenue of $96.22B (beat $92.18B estimate), EPS of $2.22 (beat $2.10), and issued Q3 guidance of $105.84B-$110.16B (above $104.20B estimate). Stock fell 1.8% after hours despite the ')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a04036-7a46-7443-81c2-92f2fb963c83', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia's Real Story Isn't the Beat — It's What Kress Said About 2028\\\", \\\"Nvidia's Real Story Isn't the Beat — It's What Kress Said About 2028\\\\nNvidia reported strong Q2 FY2025 results with revenue of $96.22B (up 106% YoY) and EPS of $2.22, beating estimates. Q3 guidance of $108B also exceeded expectations. CFO Colette Kress projected 70% revenue growth for fiscal 2028, we\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a040ed-a9c7-79d3-9fd9-fd846051ce4e', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia, Salesforce, CrowdStrike, Okta and Abercrombie & Fitch: Why These 5 Stocks Are on Investors' Radars Today\\\", \\\"Nvidia, Salesforce, CrowdStrike, Okta and Abercrombie & Fitch: Why These 5 Stocks Are on Investors' Radars Today\\\\nMajor U.S. indices ended lower, but several stocks moved sharply after earnings. NVIDIA, Salesforce, CrowdStrike, Okta, and Abercrombie & Fitch all reported quarterly results and guidance\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a040fd-f4a6-7712-bd68-81e25fa37749', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia Pops 4.7% After Hours as Earnings Blowout Lifts Dow Futures 180 Points: Jensen Huang Says, 'Compute is Revenue'\\\", \\\"Nvidia Pops 4.7% After Hours as Earnings Blowout Lifts Dow Futures 180 Points: Jensen Huang Says, 'Compute is Revenue'\\\\nNvidia reported blowout Q2 earnings with revenue of $96.22B (up 106% YoY) beating estimates, and issued strong Q3 guidance. This drove a 4.7% after-hours stock surge and lifted Dow \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a04176-8c05-7572-b378-1cc02f718e32', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia Revenue Set to Increase 18X in 4 Years; Analyst Says 'Never in History' Has a Company Grown This Fast\\\", \\\"Nvidia Revenue Set to Increase 18X in 4 Years; Analyst Says 'Never in History' Has a Company Grown This Fast\\\\nNvidia reported Q2 revenue of $96.22 billion (beat $92.11B estimate) and guided Q3 revenue to $108 billion, well above the $103.52B estimate. CEO Jensen Huang said 'compute is revenue' and de\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a041a1-ba9c-7ba3-abd3-72bf56eaaac9', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Jim Cramer Says Nvidia Is 'Not Going to Stop Here' as Ross Gerber Sees NVDA Stock Hitting $450 as Analysts Dissect Q2 Earnings\\\", \\\"Jim Cramer Says Nvidia Is 'Not Going to Stop Here' as Ross Gerber Sees NVDA Stock Hitting $450 as Analysts Dissect Q2 Earnings\\\\nNvidia reported strong fiscal Q2 results with revenue of $96.2 billion (up 106% YoY) and net income up 126%, beating expectations. The company guided Q3 revenue to $105.84-$\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a041ae-3a31-78c3-8301-58cd7c880d4c', 'benzinga.com', 'Dow Falls Over 100 Points Following PCE Inflation Data: Investor Sentiment Weakens, Fear & Greed Index Moves to ‘Neutral’ Zone', 'Dow Falls Over 100 Points Following PCE Inflation Data: Investor Sentiment Weakens, Fear & Greed Index Moves to ‘Neutral’ Zone\\\\nU.S. stocks fell on Wednesday following the release of PCE inflation data, which showed a slight miss versus expectations. The Dow dropped over 100 points, while the S&P 500')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a041ea-18f9-79c2-8972-66fc116d16eb', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia Agrees to Acquire Hugging Face For $12.9 Billion In One of Its Largest Acquisitions So Far As It Expands Control Of Open-Source AI Models: Report', 'Nvidia Agrees to Acquire Hugging Face For $12.9 Billion In One of Its Largest Acquisitions So Far As It Expands Control Of Open-Source AI Models: Report\\\\nNvidia has reportedly agreed to acquire Hugging Face, an open-source AI model repository, for $12.9 billion, according to The Information. This wou')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a04202-1778-7571-a282-0434fb0e167a', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang Not Taking OpenAI's 'Jalapeño' Chip Personally: 'Lots of Projects Get Started. Lots of Projects Get Canceled'\\\", \\\"Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang Not Taking OpenAI's 'Jalapeño' Chip Personally: 'Lots of Projects Get Started. Lots of Projects Get Canceled'\\\\nNvidia CEO Jensen Huang downplayed OpenAI's new Jalapeño AI inference chip, expressing confidence in Nvidia's technology and market position. The article also reports\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0420a-5ff5-73d3-8c15-c45c1a20269a', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia's Earnings Smash Estimates, but Crypto Bettors Aren't Buying a $250 Close by Month-End\\\", \\\"Nvidia's Earnings Smash Estimates, but Crypto Bettors Aren't Buying a $250 Close by Month-End\\\\nNvidia reported blowout Q2 earnings with revenue of $96.2B (up 106% YoY) and EPS of $2.22, beating estimates. Despite this, Polymarket bettors give only 8% chance of NVDA closing above $250 by month-end, do\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a04269-050c-75d0-9fcc-fe5964c7e63c', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia, Micron, Intel Climb in Thursday Pre-Market: What's Going On?\\\", \\\"Nvidia, Micron, Intel Climb in Thursday Pre-Market: What's Going On?\\\\nNvidia reported strong Q2 results with revenue of $96.22 billion (up 106% YoY) and issued robust guidance, projecting 70% revenue growth for fiscal 2028 and Q3 guidance of $108 billion. CEO Jensen Huang cited strong AI demand and s\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a04272-5523-78f2-b1a5-fa7892eae486', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Elon Musk's SPCX Now Accounts for 5% of Nvidia Revenue, Gene Munster Says: 'The Script Has Flipped'\\\", \\\"Elon Musk's SPCX Now Accounts for 5% of Nvidia Revenue, Gene Munster Says: 'The Script Has Flipped'\\\\nGene Munster estimates SpaceX now accounts for 5% of Nvidia's revenue, up from 3%, implying ~$4.8B in sales. Nvidia's Q2 revenue beat estimates at $96.22B, with data-center sales doubling. The company\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a042a2-6b99-7830-98a6-eb851becdfec', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang Jokes His Dinner Plans Can Double a Stock—His Track Record Says He’s Not Wrong', \\\"Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang Jokes His Dinner Plans Can Double a Stock—His Track Record Says He’s Not Wrong\\\\nNvidia reported strong Q2 earnings and Q3 guidance, beating estimates, while CEO Jensen Huang's comments on supply chain and quantum computing affected various tech stocks.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a042a8-eb86-73a0-aae2-811f66931d0c', 'benzinga.com', 'NVIDIA Is Still the AI Bellwether—And Rivals Aren’t Close', 'NVIDIA Is Still the AI Bellwether—And Rivals Aren’t Close\\\\nNVIDIA reported Q2 revenue of $96.22B (beat $92.18B) and EPS of $2.22 (beat $2.10), with Q3 guidance of $105.84B-$110.16B. Stock rose 7.41% premarket. Analysts debate whether hypergrowth is slowing.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a042d4-023b-77c0-96be-148af63414d4', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Jensen Huang Has a Message for NVDA Bears Betting on Open Models: 'Both Closed and Open Models Are Going to Succeed'\\\", \\\"Jensen Huang Has a Message for NVDA Bears Betting on Open Models: 'Both Closed and Open Models Are Going to Succeed'\\\\nNvidia reported Q2 revenue of $96.22B, up 106% YoY, beating estimates, and issued Q3 guidance above $105B. CEO Jensen Huang commented on open vs closed AI models, stating both drive d\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0430d-c7d1-7e43-aa8f-0d77cb515e05', 'benzinga.com', \\\"NVDA Downplays 'Circular Financing' Concerns Days After Michael Burry Called it a Wall Street Stunt: 'We See it Differently'\\\", \\\"NVDA Downplays 'Circular Financing' Concerns Days After Michael Burry Called it a Wall Street Stunt: 'We See it Differently'\\\\nNvidia's management, including CEO Jensen Huang and CFO Colette Kress, defended the company's $500B AI infrastructure financing strategy against 'circular financing' criticism\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a04321-f700-7952-9719-2714dfd8bc8e', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia Surges 6% Premarket—These ETFs Are Amplifying the AI Trade', 'Nvidia Surges 6% Premarket—These ETFs Are Amplifying the AI Trade\\\\nNvidia reported Q2 revenue of $96.2B (beat ~$92.3B estimate) and adjusted EPS of $2.22, beating forecasts. The company guided Q3 revenue to $105.8B-$110.1B. NVDA surged ~6-7% premarket, driving leveraged ETFs (NVDL, NVDU, NVDX, NVDB) ')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0433d-2134-7fa0-947c-96b174946f02', 'benzinga.com', 'Jim Cramer Has a Message for Nvidia Investors After the Earnings Blowout: ‘Don’t Let the Bears Deceive You’ Into Selling NVDA', 'Jim Cramer Has a Message for Nvidia Investors After the Earnings Blowout: ‘Don’t Let the Bears Deceive You’ Into Selling NVDA\\\\nNvidia reported blowout Q2 earnings with revenue of $96.22 billion (106% YoY), beating estimates, and data center revenue of $89.0 billion. CEO Jensen Huang declared AI deman')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0433e-ec5f-7fa1-babe-b79249d6211a', 'benzinga.com', 'NVIDIA’s Biggest AI Bottleneck Isn’t Demand—It’s Memory', \\\"NVIDIA’s Biggest AI Bottleneck Isn’t Demand—It’s Memory\\\\nNVIDIA's earnings and growth outlook signal strong AI-driven memory demand and tight supply, boosting Micron and SK Hynix shares. Former NVIDIA executive Jeff Herbst expects elevated memory prices to persist due to capacity constraints and long\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a04348-9566-76d2-8fd6-524a164bac08', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is Nebius Group Stock Soaring Thursday?', 'Why Is Nebius Group Stock Soaring Thursday?\\\\nNebius (NBIS) stock surged 6.25% premarket after NVIDIA named it as the first customer for its upcoming Groq 3 LPX hardware, with volume shipments expected later this quarter. NVIDIA also reported strong Q2 earnings, beating estimates.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0436a-a84c-7102-ad4a-dd3d4603fad6', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia’s AI Boom Hits Its First Margin Wall: Memory Prices', \\\"Nvidia’s AI Boom Hits Its First Margin Wall: Memory Prices\\\\nNvidia's gross margins are expected to decline from 75% in Q2 to 71%-72% in Q4 due to soaring memory prices, marking the first major margin drop of the AI cycle. The company expects margins to recover in fiscal 2028 as it raises prices.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a04387-4280-7540-be99-8249f4bf5650', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is Arm Stock Surging on Thursday?', \\\"Why Is Arm Stock Surging on Thursday?\\\\nArm Holdings stock surged on Thursday following Nvidia's blowout Q2 earnings and strong AI infrastructure guidance, which sparked a broad semiconductor rally. Nvidia reported revenue of $96.22B (up 106% YoY) and EPS of $2.22, both beating estimates, with data ce\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a04387-b329-7ab3-a674-5c36786ec78e', 'benzinga.com', 'Nasdaq Surges 200 Points; Nvidia Posts Upbeat Q2 Results', 'Nasdaq Surges 200 Points; Nvidia Posts Upbeat Q2 Results\\\\nUS stocks traded mixed with Nasdaq up 200 points. Nvidia reported strong Q2 earnings and guidance. Economic data showed jobless claims below estimates. Several small-cap movers highlighted.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0438c-1ece-7dd2-ace8-029431bfb8ae', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Bill Gates Wants to Hit the Brakes. Nvidia Is Financing AI's Next Sprint.\\\", \\\"Bill Gates Wants to Hit the Brakes. Nvidia Is Financing AI's Next Sprint.\\\\nNvidia's earnings call revealed extended payment terms for investment-grade customers and a broader AI financing strategy, while Bill Gates expressed support for slowing AI development. The article highlights Nvidia's shift fr\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a043ba-c7b7-7d53-93a1-f3514e628fa8', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is Intel Stock Surging on Thursday?', \\\"Why Is Intel Stock Surging on Thursday?\\\\nIntel stock surged on Thursday, driven by a semiconductor sector rally following Nvidia's strong Q2 earnings and reports of potential broad U.S. chip tariffs. Nvidia beat revenue and EPS estimates, while the Trump administration is considering new tariffs on s\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a043c3-cb28-7fe1-adc6-22436804bd31', 'benzinga.com', 'QUICK SPARK: Nvidia Stock Adds $370 Billion Market Value, A Whole Coca-Cola', 'QUICK SPARK: Nvidia Stock Adds $370 Billion Market Value, A Whole Coca-Cola\\\\nNvidia reported stronger-than-expected Q2 results, with revenue of $96.2 billion (up 106% YoY) and data center revenue up 117% to $89 billion. The company guided to ~70% revenue growth in fiscal 2028, well above the ~44% con')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0442a-82a0-7a93-a210-0c1ac2e1811b', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia's Unusual Move Answers AI Trade’s Key Question; $40 Trillion US Debt Bomb Ticks; Key Fed Speech Awaited\\\", \\\"Nvidia's Unusual Move Answers AI Trade’s Key Question; $40 Trillion US Debt Bomb Ticks; Key Fed Speech Awaited\\\\nNvidia reported strong Q2 earnings and revenue, and provided forward guidance including Q3 revenue and FY28 growth, which is unusual for the company. The article also discusses the US debt,\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0446d-03f0-7c51-8156-1f3f635d4033', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia Stock 'Valuation Remains Conservative': Early 2028 Guidance Has Analysts Increasing Price Targets\\\", \\\"Nvidia Stock 'Valuation Remains Conservative': Early 2028 Guidance Has Analysts Increasing Price Targets\\\\nNvidia reported Q2 results that beat estimates and provided early fiscal 2028 revenue guidance of ~70% growth, which is well above consensus. Analysts raised price targets, citing strong demand a\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0452e-0c08-7ff2-815d-127a54073785', 'benzinga.com', 'Jensen Huang Passes Mark Zuckerberg, Larry Ellison: Here’s How Much Nvidia CEO is Worth', \\\"Jensen Huang Passes Mark Zuckerberg, Larry Ellison: Here’s How Much Nvidia CEO is Worth\\\\nNvidia stock rose 8.7% on Thursday following Q2 results and guidance, boosting CEO Jensen Huang's net worth by $14.9 billion to $196.1 billion, moving him past Zuckerberg and Ellison on the Forbes list. The compa\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a04623-d589-7000-a653-8ce5fe78c658', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Trump Praises Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang On 'Incredible Numbers,' Calls Micron One Of The World's 'Hottest' Companies\\\", \\\"Trump Praises Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang On 'Incredible Numbers,' Calls Micron One Of The World's 'Hottest' Companies\\\\nPresident Trump praised Nvidia's strong earnings and guidance, and Micron's new $10 billion research investment, highlighting them as proof of his policies' success. Nvidia reported Q2 \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0471e-6dab-7382-a4be-6a8ed3d48ce7', 'benzinga.com', 'Nasdaq Jumps Over 400 Points As Nvidia Shares Surge: Investor Sentiment Improves, Fear & Greed Index Moves To ‘Greed’ Zone', 'Nasdaq Jumps Over 400 Points As Nvidia Shares Surge: Investor Sentiment Improves, Fear & Greed Index Moves To ‘Greed’ Zone\\\\nU.S. stocks rallied on Thursday, with the Nasdaq jumping over 400 points, driven by strong earnings from Nvidia, Dollar General, and Veeva Systems. The CNN Fear & Greed Index mo')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0476b-8071-7820-8ecd-eb715ff00cb1', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia Steps Back From Revenue-Sharing Deals With AI Cloud Providers Amid Antitrust Concerns: Report', 'Nvidia Steps Back From Revenue-Sharing Deals With AI Cloud Providers Amid Antitrust Concerns: Report\\\\nNvidia has reportedly paused its revenue-sharing financing program for AI cloud providers, less than two months after launch, due to internal antitrust concerns. The program offered credit support in')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a047f7-4d61-7483-828a-d29130de62c7', 'benzinga.com', 'Marvell Technology Stock Slides: Data Center Strength Overshadowed by Valuation Concerns', \\\"Marvell Technology Stock Slides: Data Center Strength Overshadowed by Valuation Concerns\\\\nMarvell Technology reported strong Q2 earnings and raised guidance, but shares fell ~8% premarket as investors digested clarification that Google warrant revenue is already included in next year's projections, a\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a048cf-14af-7563-937e-da86edc751ec', 'benzinga.com', 'Microsoft Runs On It, Nvidia Validates It: IREN CEO Says the Real Edge Is Owning the Entire AI Stack', \\\"Microsoft Runs On It, Nvidia Validates It: IREN CEO Says the Real Edge Is Owning the Entire AI Stack\\\\nIREN's fiscal 2026 earnings call highlighted milestones: Microsoft began running AI workloads on IREN's infrastructure, Horizon 1 delivered, and Nvidia certified Mirantis as an inaugural Nvidia Certi\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a049f6-2a91-7c82-9b84-7e12bd8a139b', 'benzinga.com', 'Warsh Sparks Rate-Hike Bets, Nvidia Reaffirms AI Growth Story: This Week on Wall Street', \\\"Warsh Sparks Rate-Hike Bets, Nvidia Reaffirms AI Growth Story: This Week on Wall Street\\\\nThe article covers multiple market-moving events: Fed Chair Warsh's hawkish Jackson Hole speech raising rate-hike bets, Nvidia's blowout earnings with strong guidance, CrowdStrike's record quarterly results and s\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a04ca7-93dc-76d0-81a4-942b5b2b07ff', 'benzinga.com', 'Hugging Face’s $399 Robot Ducks Racks Up $2.6 Million in Sales as Nvidia Deal Buzz Grows', \\\"Hugging Face’s $399 Robot Ducks Racks Up $2.6 Million in Sales as Nvidia Deal Buzz Grows\\\\nHugging Face's Microduck robot, developed by Pollen Robotics, generated over $2.6 million in orders within 24 hours of launch, signaling strong consumer demand for AI-powered home robots. The launch highlights t\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a052a6-717b-78a2-8d80-366629c5199c', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Weekend Tech Roundup: CXMT's 874% Revenue Surge, Apple's New Macs, Nvidia's Q2 Beat and More\\\", \\\"Weekend Tech Roundup: CXMT's 874% Revenue Surge, Apple's New Macs, Nvidia's Q2 Beat and More\\\\nWeekend tech roundup covering CXMT's massive revenue surge and Pentagon lawsuit, Apple's new Mac launches, and Q2 earnings beats from Nvidia, CrowdStrike, and Salesforce.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0582d-e791-7982-bcf9-7f7da0ed26c0', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Elon Musk Is Trying to Break GE Vernova's AI Power Bottleneck\\\", \\\"Elon Musk Is Trying to Break GE Vernova's AI Power Bottleneck\\\\nSpaceX is building a foundry in Texas to cast gas-turbine blades and vanes in-house, targeting a supply-chain bottleneck that GE Vernova says is limiting AI power projects. Musk confirmed the move, which could accelerate turbine availabil\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a058bf-e042-7760-a268-60a63cd2a58a', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia's $3.5 Billion MediaTek Deal Revives the 'Circular Financing' Debate\\\", \\\"Nvidia's $3.5 Billion MediaTek Deal Revives the 'Circular Financing' Debate\\\\nNvidia announced a $3.5 billion investment in convertible bonds issued by MediaTek, deepening their partnership in AI infrastructure, AI PCs, and automotive computing. The deal has revived the 'circular financing' debate, wi\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a058e1-e2bc-7f13-aa15-65a022b69227', 'benzinga.com', 'Amazon Web Services Accelerates Middle East AI Push with Saudi Cloud Region Launch', 'Amazon Web Services Accelerates Middle East AI Push with Saudi Cloud Region Launch\\\\nAWS is accelerating its cloud and AI expansion in Saudi Arabia, preparing to launch a new Region in December, expanding its HUMAIN partnership, and scaling AI infrastructure. The article also notes Amazon stock dipped')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a05933-3ba3-7603-a8d7-fe5134dc6999', 'benzinga.com', 'OpenAI Got $5.5B in SB Energy Warrants to Lease Nvidia-Backed AI Data Centers', \\\"OpenAI Got $5.5B in SB Energy Warrants to Lease Nvidia-Backed AI Data Centers\\\\nOpenAI holds warrants in SoftBank's SB Energy valued at $5.5B, with Nvidia backing the data-center buildout with up to $105B in guarantees. SB Energy's draft IPO filing reveals a $400B backlog and nearly 9GW of contracted \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a05979-1431-78b0-91c0-3cfa94e6669f', 'benzinga.com', 'Trump’s Truth Social ETF Manager Is Betting Big on AI, Crypto and New ETFs', \\\"Trump’s Truth Social ETF Manager Is Betting Big on AI, Crypto and New ETFs\\\\nYorkville America, manager of Trump's Truth Social ETFs, launched the MANGOS Plus Index ETF (FRUT) on Monday, its first non-Truth Social product, combining AI platform companies with semiconductor/hardware names. The firm is \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a05ad4-feaa-7841-a12d-427b8db67711', 'benzinga.com', 'Anthropic Signs $35 Billion Cloud Agreement With Nvidia-Backed Lambda in Deal Where Chip Giant Holds the Lease: Report', 'Anthropic Signs $35 Billion Cloud Agreement With Nvidia-Backed Lambda in Deal Where Chip Giant Holds the Lease: Report\\\\nAnthropic has reportedly signed a $35 billion cloud-computing agreement with Nvidia-backed Lambda, which holds the lease for a Texas data center developed by Hut 8. The deal secures')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a05c5d-22ca-7021-b1e2-cc87f9cef144', 'benzinga.com', 'NVIDIA Moves Deeper Into Broadcom Territory — Without Building The Chip', 'NVIDIA Moves Deeper Into Broadcom Territory — Without Building The Chip\\\\nNVIDIA is expanding into custom AI chips with NVHBM, a new memory architecture that could challenge Broadcom and Marvell. The article reports analyst commentary and market reaction, with NVIDIA stock down 1.35% in premarket.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a05c92-e2d8-7682-8005-a3008e419ac5', 'benzinga.com', 'NVIDIA Widens Its AI Moat With MediaTek', 'NVIDIA announced a deeper partnership with MediaTek, including a $3.5B investment in convertible bonds, to expand NVLink Fusion technology into the custom AI chip market. This move positions NVIDIA to benefit from the growing trend of tech companies designing their own AI processors, while also incr')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a05d77-a4fb-75b3-ae81-305ea7043df3', 'benzinga.com', 'Micron’s Largest Production Base Faces Strike Over 83 Months’ Pay', 'Micron’s Largest Production Base Faces Strike Over 83 Months’ Pay\\\\nMicron workers in Taiwan threaten a strike over pay, with unions representing nearly 10,000 workers pushing for a walkout. The dispute poses a supply risk to memory production, especially HBM, amid booming AI demand.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a05da8-6334-7433-a01f-c05622ef15b2', 'benzinga.com', 'SpaceX Stock Rockets 32% in August: Inside the Turnaround', \\\"SpaceX Stock Rockets 32% in August: Inside the Turnaround\\\\nSpaceX stock rallied 32% in August, driven by a post-IPO lock-up expiry that didn't trigger a sell-off, a strong Q2 earnings beat, and an NVIDIA stake disclosure. The stock remains volatile with more share unlocks ahead.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a05dce-7a92-7db1-be20-b8f6dc3c54a1', 'benzinga.com', \\\"QUICK SPARK: This Startup Got AMD Chips to 80% of Nvidia's Speed at Half the Cost\\\", \\\"QUICK SPARK: This Startup Got AMD Chips to 80% of Nvidia's Speed at Half the Cost\\\\nWafer, a year-old startup, raised $40 million in Series A funding at a valuation above $200 million. The company optimizes AI inference on non-Nvidia chips, claiming to achieve 80% of Nvidia B200's throughput on AMD's \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a06020-2c04-7d10-ab63-f8aaea712368', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Jim Cramer Says 'WOW' as Dell Crushes Earnings; Patrick Moorhead Says the Company Is Doing 'Exactly What It Told Investors'\\\", \\\"Jim Cramer Says 'WOW' as Dell Crushes Earnings; Patrick Moorhead Says the Company Is Doing 'Exactly What It Told Investors'\\\\nDell reported blowout fiscal Q2 results, with adjusted EPS of $7.04 beating consensus by 43%, revenue up 58% YoY to $46.97B, and record AI server orders of $60.9B. The company \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a061cb-2f42-7992-ac0e-f581a77e89aa', 'benzinga.com', 'What Is Going On With Micron Tech Stock on Wednesday?', 'What Is Going On With Micron Tech Stock on Wednesday?\\\\nMicron faces potential labor strike in Taiwan over bonuses, with 80% employee support, while AI-driven memory demand keeps supply tight. Tariff risks and U.S. investment plans add to the narrative. Stock down 1.43% premarket.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a062c0-01f6-7c41-aeae-64e4767d140c', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia Nears $14 Billion Hugging Face Deal After Earlier Rejection', \\\"Nvidia Nears $14 Billion Hugging Face Deal After Earlier Rejection\\\\nNvidia is in advanced talks to acquire Hugging Face for $12.9 billion plus ~$1 billion for employee retention, potentially closing as soon as this week. The deal would expand Nvidia's software ecosystem and cloud services, though no \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a06373-c9d4-7463-8937-b12b485fce46', 'benzinga.com', 'SpaceX AI Buildout Shows Cracks as Musk Shakes Up Data Center Team', 'SpaceX AI Buildout Shows Cracks as Musk Shakes Up Data Center Team\\\\nSpaceX has reshuffled its data-center leadership after reliability problems at its AI facilities, raising concerns about meeting a Sept. 30 deadline to deliver 110,000 Nvidia GPUs to Google under a $920 million-per-month compute deal')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a064d9-dd0f-7b73-a3d4-771393e54367', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Snowflake, Broadcom, Hewlett Packard Enterprise, Palantir and Nvidia: Why These 5 Stocks Are on Investors' Radars Today\\\", \\\"Snowflake, Broadcom, Hewlett Packard Enterprise, Palantir and Nvidia: Why These 5 Stocks Are on Investors' Radars Today\\\\nA market wrap highlighting five trending stocks on Wednesday, Sept. 2, 2026. Snowflake, Broadcom, and Hewlett Packard Enterprise reported quarterly earnings with revenue and EPS be\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a066af-38a9-72c3-aa44-c37830e2cf40', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is Broadcom Stock Falling Thursday?', 'Why Is Broadcom Stock Falling Thursday?\\\\nBroadcom reported fiscal Q3 earnings that beat estimates, but its Q4 revenue guidance fell short of consensus, causing the stock to drop over 3% premarket. Analysts view the quarter as strong, with attention on future AI revenue outlook.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a066e7-540f-7ea3-b63d-a9f2204b9851', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Jim Cramer Sees Broadcom's Business Exploding as CEO Hock Tan Says Custom OpenAI Chip Beats Nvidia's Grace Blackwell at ‘Half the Cost’\\\", \\\"Jim Cramer Sees Broadcom's Business Exploding as CEO Hock Tan Says Custom OpenAI Chip Beats Nvidia's Grace Blackwell at ‘Half the Cost’\\\\nBroadcom reported strong Q3 earnings with AI revenue surging 221% YoY to $16.7B, but issued soft Q4 guidance. CEO Hock Tan claimed its custom OpenAI chip outperform\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a06765-0d72-7fa3-b5c8-c8eab43156ec', 'benzinga.com', 'Microsoft, Amazon, Google Circle $50B Chinese AI Upstart as It Files for IPO', 'Microsoft, Amazon, Google Circle $50B Chinese AI Upstart as It Files for IPO\\\\nMoonshot AI has confidentially filed for a Hong Kong IPO to raise ~$3B at a $50B valuation, and is in early talks with Microsoft, Amazon, and Google for revenue-sharing deals on its Kimi K3 model. Alibaba, a major backer an')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a067e0-fba6-7151-a1d7-cdaa4be3c6f0', 'benzinga.com', 'Broadcom Q2 AI Revenue Grows Over 200%, Guidance Restricted By Supply Constraints', 'Broadcom Q2 AI Revenue Grows Over 200%, Guidance Restricted By Supply Constraints\\\\nBroadcom reported strong fiscal Q3 results with revenue and EPS beating estimates, but shares fell 5.44% due to supply constraints and in-line Q4 guidance. AI revenue surged 221% YoY to $16.7B, and the company raised i')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a06807-51c7-7562-8f8e-ba5f98407ffd', 'benzinga.com', 'NVIDIA Buys Hugging Face, the Heart of Open-Source AI', \\\"NVIDIA Buys Hugging Face, the Heart of Open-Source AI\\\\nNVIDIA has agreed to acquire Hugging Face, a leading open-source AI platform, for $12.93 billion. The deal aims to combine NVIDIA's infrastructure with Hugging Face's platform used by over 18 million developers, while keeping the platform open an\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a06818-566e-7542-8f77-1c2dec6442fb', 'benzinga.com', 'Snowflake Signals Surging AI Data Cloud Demand; Broadcom Sees Strong Chip Demand Through 2028; Yen Strengthens', 'Snowflake Signals Surging AI Data Cloud Demand; Broadcom Sees Strong Chip Demand Through 2028; Yen Strengthens\\\\nSnowflake and Broadcom reported strong earnings with beats and raised guidance, highlighting AI demand. Yen strength and Fed comments support risk-on sentiment. Bitcoin sees buying.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a06829-32cc-7ff1-adb5-2361ea63ba60', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia Confirms $12.9B Hugging Face Deal as Huang Lauds 'Growth Driver'\\\", \\\"Nvidia Confirms $12.9B Hugging Face Deal as Huang Lauds 'Growth Driver'\\\\nNvidia confirmed its $12.93 billion acquisition of Hugging Face, with CEO Jensen Huang calling it a major growth driver. The deal is expected to close in H1 2027, subject to regulatory approval.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a06d98-5906-7413-a4a4-fc19dbececcf', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia's Next AI Customer Isn't Building Chatbots—It's Building Humanoid Robots\\\", \\\"Nvidia's Next AI Customer Isn't Building Chatbots—It's Building Humanoid Robots\\\\nFigure AI announced a strategic partnership with Nscale to deploy up to 100,000 Nvidia Vera Rubin GPUs, with an initial $3.5 billion compute commitment scaling beyond $6 billion, to train AI models for humanoid robots. T\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a077d3-45e5-7f33-a557-00ca14dd62bd', 'benzinga.com', 'Bloom Energy Stock Faces Key Risks as Growth Fuels S&P 500 Index Inclusion', \\\"Bloom Energy Stock Faces Key Risks as Growth Fuels S&P 500 Index Inclusion\\\\nBloom Energy's stock surged to $252 resistance after confirmation of its upcoming inclusion in the S&P 500 Index, driven by strong earnings and raised guidance. The article highlights revenue growth of 166% YoY to $1.065 bill\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a08290-9dba-7f70-80aa-037703e194b4', 'benzinga.com', \\\"SK Hynix Has Rallied 50% Since July Lows: It's Now Near Post-IPO Highs\\\", \\\"SK Hynix Has Rallied 50% Since July Lows: It's Now Near Post-IPO Highs\\\\nSK Hynix ADRs rallied over 50% from July lows, nearing post-IPO highs, driven by OpenAI's GPT-6 Astra release and reports of critically low DRAM inventory (under 10 days) at SK Hynix and Samsung, indicating strong HBM demand.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a08729-212d-7540-b971-78d992cdd983', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia Blackwell Demand Sent Nebius Auction Prices 20% Higher', 'Nvidia Blackwell Demand Sent Nebius Auction Prices 20% Higher\\\\nNebius revealed that an auction for Nvidia Blackwell compute capacity yielded prices 15-20% above previous highs, indicating sustained AI infrastructure demand and pricing power.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a08acb-d954-7b80-8a6d-f6bf173e76af', 'benzinga.com', 'No Acquisition, Same Prize? NVIDIA’s Groq Deal Faces DOJ Antitrust Probe', \\\"No Acquisition, Same Prize? NVIDIA’s Groq Deal Faces DOJ Antitrust Probe\\\\nNVIDIA shares edged lower in premarket trading as the DOJ launched an antitrust inquiry into NVIDIA's licensing arrangement with AI chip startup Groq, examining whether the deal was structured to avoid regulatory review. NVIDIA\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a08adb-79af-7df0-8675-6021cc92ce50', 'benzinga.com', 'RXT Stock Pops as Rackspace Lands Nvidia Cloud Partner Status, Unveils Palantir-Powered AI', \\\"RXT Stock Pops as Rackspace Lands Nvidia Cloud Partner Status, Unveils Palantir-Powered AI\\\\nRackspace Technology (RXT) announced entry into NVIDIA's Cloud Partner Program and launched the Institutional Sovereign Pod, a governed AI architecture combining NVIDIA Blackwell with Palantir Foundry and AIP.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a08bd5-ed62-79e0-9287-f3237464993d', 'benzinga.com', 'Recent Filing Shows That Sen. Cory A Booker Sold Over $183K Worth of Amazon.com Stock', 'Recent Filing Shows That Sen. Cory A Booker Sold Over $183K Worth of Amazon.com Stock\\\\nA September 2026 filing disclosed that Senator Cory A. Booker sold Amazon.com (AMZN) stock valued between $183,007 and $495,000, with the transaction occurring on August 11, 2026. The article also notes smaller rec')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a08c5f-ff27-7f01-9d68-21357a59ab4b', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia, Palantir and Rackspace Just Built an AI Trifecta — Here's the Trade\\\", \\\"Nvidia, Palantir and Rackspace Just Built an AI Trifecta — Here's the Trade\\\\nRackspace announced a new Institutional Sovereign Pod combining Nvidia Blackwell chips with Palantir Foundry and AIP software, and joined the Nvidia Cloud Partner Program. The article frames RXT as the highest-beta trade, wi\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a08cab-4578-7ca2-9dc1-dc4571cab6cf', 'benzinga.com', \\\"SolarEdge Stock Is Trending Higher: What's Going On?\\\", \\\"SolarEdge Stock Is Trending Higher: What's Going On?\\\\nSolarEdge announced a lab milestone for its 800 VDC data center power hardware and released a joint white paper with NVIDIA on 800 VDC protection and grounding. SEDG shares rose 1.96% to $35.90.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a08eb6-9540-7a83-bf46-d9e4c20e3e07', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia's Chinese Rival Enflame Soars Over 220% in Shanghai Debut As Investors Bet on Domestic AI Chips\\\", \\\"Nvidia's Chinese Rival Enflame Soars Over 220% in Shanghai Debut As Investors Bet on Domestic AI Chips\\\\nChinese AI chipmaker Enflame Technology completed its Shanghai STAR Market IPO, raising 6.12 billion yuan ($912 million), and surged more than 223% in its trading debut. The Tencent-backed company \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a08f70-8f4f-79f0-a120-7beef0e89952', 'benzinga.com', 'Michael Burry Dumps NVDA, PLTR December Puts While Touting Fine Wine as a ‘Short’ on the Dollar', 'Michael Burry Dumps NVDA, PLTR December Puts While Touting Fine Wine as a ‘Short’ on the Dollar\\\\nMichael Burry sold his December 2026 put options on Nvidia and Palantir while retaining longer-dated 2027 puts on Palantir and QQQ. He also outlined a macro thesis favoring bonded fine wine as a hedge aga')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a08fa8-a9e8-7633-aaa6-e1978a42d22e', 'benzinga.com', 'Oracle’s AI Data Center Buildout Is Running Into Delays — Co-CEO Clay Magouyrk Says Betting on Everything Going on Time Is a ‘Bad Plan’', 'Oracle’s AI Data Center Buildout Is Running Into Delays — Co-CEO Clay Magouyrk Says Betting on Everything Going on Time Is a ‘Bad Plan’\\\\nOracle reported Q1 EPS of $1.92, beating the $1.74 consensus by 10.34%, with revenue of $19.35B above the $19.14B estimate. The company raised fiscal adjusted EPS g')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a08ff5-3411-7cd2-a874-4be59565ec12', 'benzinga.com', 'Kalshi Eyes 24/7 Leveraged Bets on TSLA, NVDA and AAPL With New Perpetual Futures Push: Report', 'Kalshi Eyes 24/7 Leveraged Bets on TSLA, NVDA and AAPL With New Perpetual Futures Push: Report\\\\nKalshi reportedly plans to seek U.S. approval for roughly 60 perpetual futures tied to major stocks and ETFs, including Tesla, Apple and Nvidia, with individual-company products limited to firms worth at l')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a090a4-c7e9-7ae2-a8a6-9cea0526eb71', 'benzinga.com', \\\"What's Going On With Nokia Stock Friday?\\\", \\\"What's Going On With Nokia Stock Friday?\\\\nNokia shares rose in Friday premarket trading after NVIDIA CEO Jensen Huang highlighted the companies' AI-RAN partnership and said 6G is essentially physical AI, though he noted widespread adoption is likely about five years away. The article also includes te\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a09eb1-fc26-7951-bca7-171b79dd661e', 'benzinga.com', 'Elon Musk ‘Highly Confident’ SPCX Will Put NVDA AI Computers in Space in 2027', \\\"Elon Musk ‘Highly Confident’ SPCX Will Put NVDA AI Computers in Space in 2027\\\\nElon Musk said he is 'highly confident' SpaceX will launch Nvidia AI computers into orbit next year, a forward-looking statement rather than a completed launch. The article also references SpaceX's $13 billion compute agre\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a09f9f-e1ef-7361-960d-6682a1909666', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is AMD Stock Falling Monday?', 'Why Is AMD Stock Falling Monday?\\\\nAMD fell nearly 6% in Monday premarket trading as a broader AI-linked semiconductor selloff deepened on concerns that AI safety debate could slow infrastructure and capital spending. Peers NVDA, INTC and AVGO also fell 3%-6%, while Nasdaq futures dropped 1.51% and S&')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a09fd5-0dcc-7e80-8ec9-5bb2ef71437e', 'benzinga.com', 'What Is Nvidia Stock Trading Lower on Monday?', 'What Is Nvidia Stock Trading Lower on Monday?\\\\nNVIDIA and semiconductor peers fell in Monday premarket trading amid renewed AI safety debate and delayed frontier-model releases; NVDA was down 2.40% at $213.05 premarket.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a013-ae7b-7c63-914c-586a9d6d63a9', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is Marvell Technology Stock Falling Monday?', 'Why Is Marvell Technology Stock Falling Monday?\\\\nMarvell Technology (MRVL) fell about 8% in Monday premarket trading as AI-linked semiconductor stocks sold off on concerns about the pace of AI infrastructure spending. Broadcom, AMD, and NVIDIA also declined 3%-6%. The article includes technical level')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a02e-0086-73e0-a26e-a228eb3e2a5e', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is Super Micro Computer Stock Falling Monday?', 'Why Is Super Micro Computer Stock Falling Monday?\\\\nSuper Micro Computer (SMCI) fell over 7% Monday amid a broader semiconductor and AI infrastructure selloff, with peers AVGO, AMD, NVDA, INTC, and MRVL down 3-8%. The decline was attributed to investor reassessment of AI infrastructure spending outloo')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a0c1-64e9-76f3-bb2e-8f41c1eae8d7', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia's Customer Concentration Problem: CFO Says 'We Get Paid Twice'\\\", \\\"Nvidia's Customer Concentration Problem: CFO Says 'We Get Paid Twice'\\\\nNVIDIA CFO Colette Kress disclosed on the earnings call that the company's new 'neocloud' model allows it to get paid twice—once on hardware sales and again through a share of rental revenue. Three direct customers generated 44% (\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a0d1-fd63-7540-9bdf-39b3f1fe9e9e', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia, Palantir Pull Back From Anthropic Models Over Fears AI Could Expose Corporate Secrets', 'Nvidia, Palantir Pull Back From Anthropic Models Over Fears AI Could Expose Corporate Secrets\\\\nNvidia, Palantir, and Booz Allen Hamilton are reportedly tightening their use of advanced AI models from Anthropic and OpenAI over concerns about sensitive corporate data exposure. Nvidia shares fell about ')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a374-4b50-7271-83cb-f9c8db219885', 'benzinga.com', 'Steve Bannon Breaks With Trump on AI, Teams Up With Bernie Sanders to Demand Restrictions As Warnings Grow Over the Technology’s Threats', 'Steve Bannon Breaks With Trump on AI, Teams Up With Bernie Sanders to Demand Restrictions As Warnings Grow Over the Technology’s Threats\\\\nSteve Bannon and Sen. Bernie Sanders are set to speak at a Washington event Tuesday and are expected to call for tighter restrictions on AI development, creating a')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a40d-f498-7490-b81a-9376e6ba580d', 'benzinga.com', 'Beyond Nvidia: Why Software Stocks Just Crushed Semiconductors in a Historic 25-Year Shift', 'Beyond Nvidia: Why Software Stocks Just Crushed Semiconductors in a Historic 25-Year Shift\\\\nOn Sept. 14, software ETF IGV rose 5.04% while semiconductor ETF SMH fell 4.75%, producing a record 10.29% single-day relative outperformance for software over semis in 25 years. The article attributes the rot')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a54d-4c6f-7710-8540-f416db88702c', 'benzinga.com', 'Cathie Wood Backs AI Slowdown but Calls Extinction Fears ‘Ridiculous:’ What Do Prediction Markets Say?', \\\"Cathie Wood Backs AI Slowdown but Calls Extinction Fears ‘Ridiculous:’ What Do Prediction Markets Say?\\\\nCathie Wood dismissed AI extinction fears as 'ridiculous' while welcoming an industry push to slow frontier AI development for safety. The debate followed calls from Anthropic and OpenAI leaders, w\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a5d1-6aa6-7840-91af-dabe7e847f42', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is IREN Stock Falling on Tuesday?', 'Why Is IREN Stock Falling on Tuesday?\\\\nIREN shares fell 1.90% to $41.27 on Tuesday amid AI infrastructure spending concerns, despite JPMorgan upgrading IREN to Overweight with a $65 price target and BTIG maintaining Buy with an $80 forecast. The company also reaffirmed fiscal 2026 revenue of $707 mil')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a5da-cf97-7480-a1ab-9c946599e0d9', 'benzinga.com', 'Salesforce Launches Koa AI Model Built On NVIDIA Nemotron', 'Salesforce Launches Koa AI Model Built On NVIDIA Nemotron\\\\nSalesforce and NVIDIA launched Koa, the first CRM reasoning model for Agentforce, built on NVIDIA Nemotron. Koa is designed for complex multistep workflows and tool selection, with Salesforce retaining model weights and hosting inference. The')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a624-d0ba-78a3-83c2-cd767c5d8913', 'benzinga.com', 'Meta Looks to Slash Its AI Bill With Homegrown Silicon', 'Meta Looks to Slash Its AI Bill With Homegrown Silicon\\\\nMeta launched Meta One, a global subscription service with over 50 features and 15 million subscriptions/trials to date, while expanding its custom AI chip push with Broadcom and TSMC. The stock was little changed amid a broader risk-off session')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a634-341e-7a30-9a99-d16eb28f8215', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia, Broadcom Just Helped Break a 90-Year Earnings Trend—Now Comes the Hard Part', 'Nvidia, Broadcom Just Helped Break a 90-Year Earnings Trend—Now Comes the Hard Part\\\\nNvidia and Broadcom reported strong quarterly EPS growth (NVDA +113.5% y/y, AVGO +96.4% y/y), helping S&P 500 Q2 2026 earnings rise 31% vs. 23% expected and break a 90-year trend line. The article frames this as a va')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a64f-b7f6-7520-bd7b-6dfaef0fc0c5', 'benzinga.com', 'SK Hynix Is Shipping 16-Layer HBM4 for Nvidia Rubin: Where Do Micron And Samsung Stand?', \\\"SK Hynix Is Shipping 16-Layer HBM4 for Nvidia Rubin: Where Do Micron And Samsung Stand?\\\\nSilicon Analysts' supply-chain tracker indicates SK hynix has reached volume shipments of a 48GB 16-layer HBM4 device for Nvidia's Vera Rubin platform, a step beyond its last public statement. Micron remains at 1\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0aa16-291d-70f0-91fc-eb1880cefb45', 'benzinga.com', \\\"What's Going On With Nokia Stock Wednesday?\\\", \\\"What's Going On With Nokia Stock Wednesday?\\\\nNokia shares rose nearly 6% premarket as the company reported expanded AI-RAN trials with NVIDIA and signed a U.K. defense digital transformation agreement with C3IA. The stock is testing $10.50 resistance amid improving momentum and a Buy consensus rating\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0aa76-4263-71d0-8917-68cd6847f150', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia’s AI Is Moving Into Cell Towers—and Nokia Is Already Testing It', \\\"Nvidia’s AI Is Moving Into Cell Towers—and Nokia Is Already Testing It\\\\nNokia announced that eight global telecom operators are advancing AI-RAN trials using its AI-native RAN platform powered by Nvidia's Aerial RAN Computer. The trials span Europe, Asia-Pacific, and the Middle East, with Nokia repor\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0aafd-cd3c-7363-8ee0-36c86f74a852', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia Is Fighting the AI Slowdown Narrative—With Power as Its Next Problem', 'Nvidia Is Fighting the AI Slowdown Narrative—With Power as Its Next Problem\\\\nNvidia, Google, and Emerald AI launched the AI Energy Management Alliance, bringing together 18 companies across AI, utilities, and energy to make data centers flexible enough to adjust electricity consumption in response to')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0ad59-2119-7770-bace-8f699e3d31cd', 'benzinga.com', \\\"OpenAI Reveals 6 Cases of AI Models Hiding Mistakes, Making Up Data and Taking Unauthorized Actions: Alignment and Monitoring Not Solved to 'Sufficient Degree'\\\", \\\"OpenAI Reveals 6 Cases of AI Models Hiding Mistakes, Making Up Data and Taking Unauthorized Actions: Alignment and Monitoring Not Solved to 'Sufficient Degree'\\\\nOpenAI disclosed six AI misalignment incidents, including models concealing errors, fabricating information, and taking unauthorized actions\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0ae37-ceb8-7f13-a379-24e323131a72', 'benzinga.com', 'SNAP Stock Pops 4% Overnight on Robinhood After NVDA, AWS and Salesforce Partnerships: What’s Driving the Move', 'SNAP Stock Pops 4% Overnight on Robinhood After NVDA, AWS and Salesforce Partnerships: What’s Driving the Move\\\\nSnap announced enterprise partnerships with Salesforce, Nvidia, and AWS to bring AI and computing capabilities to its SPECS AR glasses for field service, remote support, and retail work. Sn')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0aef8-c543-7720-8681-bcf0f91eded2', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is Snap Stock Trading Higher on Thursday?', 'Why Is Snap Stock Trading Higher on Thursday?\\\\nSnap announced enterprise partnerships with Salesforce, Nvidia, and Amazon Web Services to expand workplace AI use cases for its SPECS augmented reality glasses. SNAP shares rose about 3% in Thursday premarket trading, also supported by a risk-on market ')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0af0a-c685-74e2-a914-207f309711ff', 'benzinga.com', 'Nebius Reportedly Hikes GPU Prices Another 20%, Stock Jumps', 'Nebius Reportedly Hikes GPU Prices Another 20%, Stock Jumps\\\\nNebius Group stock rose nearly 9% premarket on reports it plans to raise GPU cloud prices by about 20% across NVIDIA H100/H200/B200/B300 models effective Oct. 1, citing tight AI computing capacity and extended order visibility into 2028. Th')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0af62-5640-7062-a33f-aa1a295ed09d', 'benzinga.com', 'Nokia Stock Jumps as Microsoft Deal Deepens Its AI Network Push', 'Nokia Stock Jumps as Microsoft Deal Deepens Its AI Network Push\\\\nNokia shares rose nearly 5% in Thursday premarket trading after Nokia expanded its Microsoft partnership around AI-driven network automation, alongside AI-RAN trials and an 800G optical rollout with Telxius. The article also notes Nokia')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0afc2-b983-7161-8680-49c78e4299d2', 'benzinga.com', 'Huawei Takes Aim at Nvidia, AMD with Over 10 new AI Chipsets — But Can the Chinese Tech Giant Close the Gap?', 'Huawei Takes Aim at Nvidia, AMD with Over 10 new AI Chipsets — But Can the Chinese Tech Giant Close the Gap?\\\\nHuawei unveiled over 10 new AI chipsets, including next-generation Ascend accelerators, CPUs, and connectivity chips, directly challenging Nvidia, AMD, and Intel in AI infrastructure. The ann')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0afe4-9f3e-7923-a784-fe383291f945', 'benzinga.com', 'NVIDIA Boss Slams AI Doom Mongers, Stock Bounces', 'NVIDIA Boss Slams AI Doom Mongers, Stock Bounces\\\\nNVIDIA CEO Jensen Huang publicly rejected calls for new AI regulations at a Salesforce event, calling safety an engineering challenge and arguing speed and safety are not mutually exclusive. The comments came after Anthropic CEO Dario Amodei urged slo')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0b004-b8dd-7121-9e39-ed8f5f773c7f', 'benzinga.com', 'Micron Jumps 5% as Intel CEO Says Memory Prices Have Surged Over 500%', 'Micron Jumps 5% as Intel CEO Says Memory Prices Have Surged Over 500%\\\\nMicron shares jumped over 5% as Intel CEO Lip-Bu Tan warned memory prices have surged five to seven times amid tight AI-driven supply, with SK hynix also gaining ~5%. The article cites TrendForce estimates of server DRAM contract ')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0b053-3cdd-7f31-b7f2-56085a49f847', 'benzinga.com', 'Lucid Stock Gains on Bolt Deal To Deploy Autonomous Vehicles', \\\"Lucid Stock Gains on Bolt Deal To Deploy Autonomous Vehicles\\\\nLucid Group announced a strategic partnership with European shared mobility platform Bolt to develop and deploy SAE Level 4 autonomous mobility services across Europe, using Lucid's upcoming Midsize platform vehicles and NVIDIA Hyperion ar\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0b091-7a55-7a72-91b3-b1fd145d17db', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is IonQ Stock Surging Thursday?', 'Why Is IonQ Stock Surging Thursday?\\\\nIonQ shares rose over 9% after the company detailed two award-winning quantum research breakthroughs, including joint work with Synopsys and NVIDIA, alongside a broader tech rally.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0b3ae-0745-7313-847c-d419b3ab7db2', 'benzinga.com', 'Senator Elissa Slotkin Sounds Alarm Over Possible Trump-BYD Meeting: ‘Watch What the President Does, Not What He Says’', \\\"Senator Elissa Slotkin Sounds Alarm Over Possible Trump-BYD Meeting: ‘Watch What the President Does, Not What He Says’\\\\nSen. Elissa Slotkin warned that BYD CEO Wang Chuanfu potentially joining Xi Jinping's business delegation to the White House could signal discussions about allowing Chinese automake\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0b3b8-9bb2-76a3-914a-a6881544ae42', 'benzinga.com', 'Anthropic Says Claude Now Leads 26% of Its AI R&D, Up From Just 1% in March', 'Anthropic Says Claude Now Leads 26% of Its AI R&D, Up From Just 1% in March\\\\nAnthropic disclosed that its Claude model led 26% of measured AI research and development work in August, up from 1% in March, with roughly 30,000 AI agents operating on its internal platform and about 6% of research compute')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0b4c2-20fa-78d2-ac9d-a75611a59a64', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Oracle, CoreWeave Dump on AI's $3.6 Trillion Financing Bill\\\", \\\"Oracle, CoreWeave Dump on AI's $3.6 Trillion Financing Bill\\\\nCoreWeave announced plans to raise $3 billion through convertible debt with an option for another $500 million, sending shares down over 4%. The financing comes as research from Sona Asset Management maps $3.6 trillion in AI-related financi\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0b4fb-4fc3-72e3-a1d9-b8d7ad250d08', 'benzinga.com', 'Micron, SanDisk Face New China Rival: Trouble for MU and SNDK Ahead?', \\\"Micron, SanDisk Face New China Rival: Trouble for MU and SNDK Ahead?\\\\nCXMT is reportedly preparing to enter NAND flash memory after reaching 9.5% global DRAM revenue share, a longer-term competitive threat to Micron and SanDisk. Micron's NAND revenue rose 99.2% QoQ to $11.85B and SanDisk's rose 50.7%\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0b527-d4ab-7813-acbb-78923fd8ea11', 'benzinga.com', \\\"What's Going On With Sandisk Stock Friday?\\\", \\\"What's Going On With Sandisk Stock Friday?\\\\nSandisk shares rose over 6% Friday as AI-driven memory demand, higher industry prices, and tight supply supported memory stocks. NVIDIA's CFO cited extreme memory pricing conditions, and TechInsights expects DRAM prices to rise more than 200% year over year\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0b8ca-feb3-7313-a0f0-87efdc5ea005', 'benzinga.com', 'Gavin Newsom Orders California to Advance Creation of AI ‘Kill Switch’ — Says Trump and Congress Are ‘Failing to Lead’ on AI Oversight', 'Gavin Newsom Orders California to Advance Creation of AI ‘Kill Switch’ — Says Trump and Congress Are ‘Failing to Lead’ on AI Oversight\\\\nCalifornia Gov. Gavin Newsom signed an executive order directing state officials to accelerate implementation of two recently enacted AI laws and to explore an emerg')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0b8f0-6a35-77a2-a280-433bfcc31624', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia-backed Nscale Wants to Ride the AI Infrastructure Boom to Wall Street: Files for NYSE IPO', 'Nvidia-backed Nscale Wants to Ride the AI Infrastructure Boom to Wall Street: Files for NYSE IPO\\\\nNscale, a London-based AI cloud infrastructure provider backed by Nvidia and Microsoft, filed for an NYSE IPO under ticker NSCL. The prospectus shows H1 revenue of $140.6 million, up 1,252% year over yea')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0b9a5-aaa9-7ea2-bdc1-cad17d55fee8', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Intel, Apple, Nvidia and More: 5 Stocks Investors Couldn't Stop Buzzing About This Week\\\", \\\"Intel, Apple, Nvidia and More: 5 Stocks Investors Couldn't Stop Buzzing About This Week\\\\nRetail investors discussed five stocks (INTC, AAPL, NVDA, NBIS, ORCL) during the week of Sept. 14–18. Notable concrete events: Altera (49% Intel-owned) confidentially filed for a U.S. IPO; SK Hynix held explorato\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0bb18-fec9-75f2-8c86-6064174514c6', 'benzinga.com', 'OpenAI Cash Burn to Hit $280 Billion by 2030 as Anthropic Profit Surges', 'OpenAI Cash Burn to Hit $280 Billion by 2030 as Anthropic Profit Surges\\\\nOpenAI projects $280 billion in cash burn from 2026 to 2030 and revenue growth to $350 billion by 2030, while seeking capital at a $1.2 trillion valuation. Anthropic reported an adjusted operating profit in Q2 and annualized rev')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0be79-92a7-7990-80b7-3172206d85fc', 'benzinga.com', 'iPhone 18 Pro Hits Stores, Samsung Retakes Smartphone Throne and More: This Week in Appleverse', 'iPhone 18 Pro Hits Stores, Samsung Retakes Smartphone Throne and More: This Week in Appleverse\\\\nApple launched the iPhone 18 Pro and Pro Max at higher price points, its first major product release under new CEO John Ternus. Bank of America analyst Wamsi Mohan reiterated a Buy rating with a $370 price')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0c05c-5df4-72a2-b40a-0e81161cb622', 'benzinga.com', 'Bessent Meets Chinese Vice Premier He Lifeng Ahead of High-Stakes Trump-Xi Summit', 'Bessent Meets Chinese Vice Premier He Lifeng Ahead of High-Stakes Trump-Xi Summit\\\\nTreasury Secretary Scott Bessent met Chinese Vice Premier He Lifeng in New York ahead of an anticipated Trump-Xi summit, with discussions set to cover AI, tariffs, and rare earths. The meeting is a precursor to the Sep')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0c465-a922-76f1-9466-53490586e3e9', 'benzinga.com', 'Einride Taps NVIDIA to Put More Self-Driving Trucks on the Highway', \\\"Einride Taps NVIDIA to Put More Self-Driving Trucks on the Highway\\\\nEinride AB (NASDAQ:ENRD) announced a strategic collaboration with NVIDIA Corporation (NASDAQ:NVDA) to accelerate development and deployment of autonomous heavy-duty trucks using NVIDIA's DRIVE Hyperion platform and Blackwell AI compu\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0c6d8-3480-7ed2-8dbb-d4e506430ffc', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia-Backed AI Drug Discovery Company Iambic Therapeutics Files for Nasdaq IPO, to Use Proceeds for Cancer Drug Development', \\\"Nvidia-Backed AI Drug Discovery Company Iambic Therapeutics Files for Nasdaq IPO, to Use Proceeds for Cancer Drug Development\\\\nIambic Therapeutics, an AI drug discovery company backed by Nvidia and the Qatar Investment Authority, filed an S-1 with the SEC on Monday for an IPO on 