More Than 1.2 Million Nvidia GB200 And GB300 Chips By Year-End ‘If We Get Lucky’\\\\nElon Musk said SpaceXAI’s Colossus 2 could run more than 1.2 million Nvidia GB200 and GB300 chips by year-end if expansion stays on schedule, up from 550,000 currently. The')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0d8a5-12ad-7b93-a912-a580b2c198e8', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is Nebius Stock Surging on Friday?', \\\"Why Is Nebius Stock Surging on Friday?\\\\nNebius Group (NBIS) shares rose Friday, extending Thursday's ~9% gain after BNP Paribas upgraded the stock to Outperform with a $399 price target (from $260). Reports also indicate Nebius plans to raise GPU cloud prices ~20% starting Oct. 1 across NVIDIA H100/H\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0d909-944c-79f0-84f3-ea38507ee194', 'benzinga.com', 'Everyone Bought Nvidia for AI: Now AMD Could Win the $211 Billion CPU Race, Bank Of America Says', \\\"Everyone Bought Nvidia for AI: Now AMD Could Win the $211 Billion CPU Race, Bank Of America Says\\\\nBank of America analyst Vivek Arya raised AMD's price target to $720 from $620, citing agentic AI driving server CPU demand. Separately, Akamai announced an $11.6 billion seven-year agreement with Anthro\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0d93c-ecae-7a62-84a1-3ac3a26af9fa', 'benzinga.com', 'RMX Industries Signs Compute Supply Purchase Order With Technologent For NVIDIA H200 GPUs To Scale QuantrusX', 'RMX Industries Signs Compute Supply Purchase Order With Technologent For NVIDIA H200 GPUs To Scale QuantrusX\\\\nRMX Industries (OTCQB:RMXI) announced it signed a compute supply purchase order with Technologent for NVIDIA H200 GPUs to scale its QuantrusX edge intelligence platform. The order is a signed')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0d973-772b-7b02-823d-08ae0b807952', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia GPU Demand Is So Extreme, Even Bad Cloud Infrastructure Is Selling, SemiAnalysis Says', 'Nvidia GPU Demand Is So Extreme, Even Bad Cloud Infrastructure Is Selling, SemiAnalysis Says\\\\nSemiAnalysis reports extreme NVI