nting Review Prompted the Search\\\\nSuper Micro appointed former Western Digital CFO Mark Long as its CFO, effective immediately, replacing David Weigand. The appointment follows a prolonged search prompted by accounting and governance scr')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a14771-019a-7530-b45b-f6bda58d95ea', 'benzinga.com', \\\"The Moment Jensen Huang Realized Nvidia 'Won't Have to Die' Came After a Call From This CEO: 'For the Whole Time, 30 Years…'\\\", \\\"The Moment Jensen Huang Realized Nvidia 'Won't Have to Die' Came After a Call From This CEO: 'For the Whole Time, 30 Years…'\\\\nTSMC reported third-quarter revenue of $46.72 billion, up 41.2% year over year and 16.2% sequentially, beating analyst estimates of $45.62 billion. Gross margin was 66.4%.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a14eab-e077-79e3-a6a9-6fc6f4643e85', 'benzinga.com', 'iPhone Duo Preorders, AAPL Crosses $5 Trillion and More: This Week in Appleverse', 'iPhone Duo Preorders, AAPL Crosses $5 Trillion and More: This Week in Appleverse\\\\nReports say Apple’s iPhone Duo sold out within minutes of preorders opening, and Apple shares climbed more than 2% in premarket trading Friday. The article also reports Apple’s market capitalization first closed above $')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a152e1-985a-7b80-b7b7-7193f8deba5a', 'benzinga.com', 'Santander Agrees Three-Year Collaboration Framework With Nvidia, Marking New AI Milestone And Building Capabilities On Nvidia AI Infrastructure', 'Santander Agrees Three-Year Collaboration Framework With Nvidia, Marking New AI Milestone And Building Capabilities On Nvidia AI Infrastructure\\\\nThe headline reports that Santander agreed to a three-year collaboration framework with Nvidia. The available article text provides no details on the framew')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a152ff-6ca6-73b3-b4b8-e5aa02712da6', 'benzinga.com', 'Samsung Turns to Rival TSMC for Nvidia’s Next-Generation Memory—Micron, SK Hynix Face Same Request: Report', \\\"Samsung Turns to Rival TSMC for Nvidia’s Next-Generation Memory—Micron, SK Hynix Face Same Request: Report\\\\nA report citing industry sources says Samsung accepted Nvidia's request to use TSMC's 3-nanometer process for the base die in Nvidia's custom NVHBM memory. This reported supplier/process arrang\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a153b1-c4fb-7dd3-9f2c-ba8556416f4c', 'benzinga.com', \\\"AI Boom Hits a Power Wall: Microsoft Walks Away From Nscale's UK Data Center Deal\\\", \\\"AI Boom Hits a Power Wall: Microsoft Walks Away From Nscale's UK Data Center Deal\\\\nMicrosoft withdrew from Nscale’s planned 50-megawatt data center project in Loughton, Essex, amid uncertainty about electricity supply; Reuters, citing the Telegraph, reported that grid power was not expected until the\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a155c5-f873-7dc2-864b-26af2754393f', 'benzinga.com', 'Amazon Just Found a Way Around Nvidia’s Biggest Moat', 'Amazon Just Found a Way Around Nvidia’s Biggest Moat\\\\nAmazon introduced TorchNeuron, an open-source tool that lets developers run PyTorch-based AI code on Trainium chips with minimal modifications. The release is intended to lower switching friction against Nvidia’s CUDA ecosystem; broader adoption a')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a15834-2f08-7b80-84ed-c78b73c7b611', 'benzinga.com', 'Big Short Investor Flags Major Vulnerability for Nvidia — 5 Customers Account for 70% of Receivables: ‘Tremendous Amount of Concentration Risk’', 'Big Short Investor Flags Major Vulnerability for Nvidia — 5 Customers Account for 70% of Receivables: ‘Tremendous Amount of Concentration Risk’\\\\nNvidia’s recent Form 10-Q reported that five unnamed direct customers represented 70% of accounts receivable. Steve Eisman cited this disclosed concentratio')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a158b7-06be-71c1-9a14-88f0a2bc47cb', 'benzinga.com', \\\"'ByteDance, Alibaba, Tencent Place Over $35 Billion Worth of Nvidia Chip Orders' - Reuters Exclusive\\\", \\\"'ByteDance, Alibaba, Tencent Place Over $35 Billion Wort